  "title": "Ziyarat at the Holy Sardab (Occultation Cellar) — Samarra",
  "data": "Ziyarat Rabi al-Anam\nThis Ziyarat is from the Book Rabeeul Anam )\nPermission to enter the Cellar\nAllamah Majlisi (a.r.) writes: I have found in an old copy of the books of our scholars the following text:\nSeeking permission to enter the holy cellar of the Imams (a.s.)\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّ هٰذِهِ بُقْعَةٌ طَهَّرْتَهَا وَعَقْوَةٌ شَرَّفْتَهَا\nALLAAHUMMA INNA HAAZEHI BUQ-A’TUN TAHHARTAHAA WA A’QWATUN SHARRAFTAHAA\nO Allah, this is a land You have purified and a place You have honored\nوَمَعَالِمُ زَكَّيْتَهَا، حَيْثُ اَظْهَرْتَ فِيْهَا اَدِلَّةَ التَّوْحِيْدِ\nWA MA-A’ALEMO ZAKKAYTAHAA HAYSO AZHARTA FEEHAA ADILLATAT TAWHEEDE\nAnd landmarks You have sanctified, where You showed signs of unity\nوَاَشْبَاحَ الْعَرْشِ الْمَجِيْدِ، الَّذِيْنَ اصْطَفَيْتَهُمْ مُلُوكاً لِحِفْظِ النِّظَامِ\nWA ASHBAAHAL A’RSHIL MAJEEDIL LAZEENAS TAFAYTAHUM MOLOOKAL LE-HIFZIN NEZAAME\nAnd the spirits of the glorious Throne, whom You chose as kings to preserve order\nوَاخْتَرْتَهٗمْ رُؤَسَاءَ لِجَمِيْعِ الْاَنَامِ، وَبَعَثْتَهُمْ لِقِيَامِ الْقِسْطِ\nWAKH TARTAHUM RO-ASAAA-A LE-JAMEE-I’L ANAAME WA BA-A’STAHUM LE-QEYAAMIL QISTE\nYou chose them as leaders for all people, and sent them to establish justice\nفِىْ البْتِدَاءِ الْوُجُودِ الىٰ يَوْمِ الْقِيَامَةِ\nFIB TEDAAA-IL WOJOODE ELAA YAWMIL QEYAAMATE\nFrom the beginning of existence until the Day of Resurrection\nثُمَّ مَنَنْتَ عَلَيْهِمْ بِاسْتِنَابَةِ أنْبِيَائِكَ لِحِفْظِ شَرَائِعِكَ\nSUMMA MANANTA A’LAYHIM BISTENAABATE ANBEYAAA-EKA LE-HIFZE SHARAAA-E-E’KA\nThen You favored them by appointing Your prophets to preserve Your laws\nوَأحْكَامِكَ، فَأكْمَلْتة بِاسْتِخْتِلَافِهِمْ رِسَالَةَ الْمُنذِرِيْنَ\nWA AHKAAMEKA FA-AKMALTAHU BIKH TELAAFEHIM RESAALATAL MUNZEREENA\nAnd Your rules, and completed it with the succession of warners’ message\nكَمَا اَوْجَبْتَ رِيَاسَتَهُمْ فِىْ فَطْرِ الْمُكَلَّفِيْنَ\nKAMAA AWJABTA REYAASATAHUM FEE FATRIL MOKALLAFEENA\nAs You made their leadership obligatory for those responsible\nفَسُبْحَانَكَ مِنْ اِلٰهٍ مَا اَرْءَفَكَ، وَلَا الٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nFASUBHAANAKA MIN ELAAHIM MAA AR-AFAKA WA LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA\nGlory be to You, O God, how compassionate You are! There is no god but You\nمِنْ مَلَكٍ مَا اَعْدَلَكَ، حَيْثُ طَابَقَ صُنْعُكَ مَا فَطَرْتَ عَلَيْهِ الْعُقُولَ\nMIM MALAKIM MAA A-A’DALAKA HAYSO TAABAQA SUN-O’KA MAA FATARTA A’LAYHIL O’QOOLA\nHow just You are as King, as Your creation matches what You instilled in minds\nوَوَافَقَ حُكْمُكَ مَا قَرَّرْتَهٗ فِىْ الْمَعْقُولِ وَالْمَنْقُولِ\nWA WAAFAQA HUKMOKA MAA QARRARTAHU FIL MA’QOOLE WAL MANQOOLE\nAnd Your judgment agrees with what You established in reason and tradition\nفَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ عَلىٰ تَقْدِيْرِكَ الْحَسَنِ الْجَمِيْلِ\nFALAKAL HAMDO A’LAA TAQDEEREKAL HASANIL JAMEELE\nSo praise be to You for Your good and beautiful decree\nوَلَكَ الشُّكْرُ عَلىٰ قَضَائِكَ الْمُعَلَّلِ بِاَكْمَلِ التَّعْلِيْلِ\nWA LAKASH SHUKRO A’LAA QAZAAA-EKAL MO-A’LLALE BE-AKMALIT TA’LEELE\nAnd thanks be to You for Your judgment, explained with perfect reasoning\nفَسُبْحَانَ مَنْ لَا يُسْئَلُ عَنْ فِعْلِهٖ وَلايُنازَعُ فِىْ أمْرِهٖ\nFASUBHAANA MAL LAA YUS-ALO A’N FE’LEHI WA LAA YONAAZA-O’ FEE AMREHI\nGlory be to Him who is not questioned about His actions, nor opposed in His command\nوَسُبْحَانَ مَنْ كَتَبَ عَلىٰ نَفْسِهِ الرَّحْمَةَ قَبْلَ ابْتِدَاءِ خَلْقِهٖ\nWA SUBHAANA MAN KATABA A’LAA NAFSEHIR RAHMATA QABLAB TEDAAA-E KHALQEHI\nAnd glory be to Him who wrote mercy upon Himself before creation began\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِىْ مَنَّ عَلَيْنَا بِحُكَّامٍ يَقُومُونَ مَقَامَهٗ\nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE MANNA A’LAYNAA BE-HUKKAAMIN-Y YAQOOMOONA MAQAAMAHU\nAnd praise be to Allah who favored us with rulers who stand in his (the Prophet's) place\nلَوْ كَانَ حَاضِراً فِىْ الْمَكَانِ، وَلَا اِلٰهَ اللهُ الَّذِىْ شَرَّفْنَا\nLAW KAANA HAAZERAN FIL MAKAANE WA LAA ELAAHAL LAAHUL LAZEE SHARRAFNAA\nas if he were present in the place; and there is no god but Allah who honored us\nبِاَوْصِيَاءَ يَحْفَظُونَ الشَّرَائِعَ فِىْ كُلِّ الْأزْمَانِ\nBE-AWSEYAAA-A YAHFAZOONASH SHARAAA-E-A’ FEE KULLIL AZMAANE\nWith guardians who preserve the laws in all times\nوَاللهُ اَكْبَرُ الَّذِىْ أظْهَرَ هُمْ لَنَا بِمُعْجِزَاتٍ\nWAL LAAHO AKBARUL LAZEE AZHARAHUM LANAA BE-MO’JEZAATIN\nAnd Allah is the Greatest, who revealed them to us with miracles\nيَعْجِزُ عَنْهَا الثَّقَلَانِ، وَلَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ الّا بِاللهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيْمِ\nYA’JEZO A’NHAS SAQALAANE WA LAA HAWLA WA LAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A’LIYYIL A’ZEEME\nThat both humans and jinn are unable to match, and there is no power or strength except with Allah, the Most High, the Most Great\nالَّذِىْ أجرَانَا عَلىٰ عَوَائِدِهِ الْجَمِيْلَةِ فِىْ الْاُمَمِ السَّالفِيْنَ\nALLAZEE AJRAANAA A’LAA A’WAAA-EDEHIL JAMEELATE FIL OMAMIS SAALFEENA\nHe who has carried us upon His beautiful customs among the past nations\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَلَكَ الْحَمْدُ وَالثَّنَاءُ الْعَلِيُّ، كَمَا وَجَبَ لِوَجْهِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA FALAKAL HAMDO WAS SANAAA-UL A’LIYYO KAMAA WAJABA LE-WAJHEKA\nO Allah, for You is the praise and lofty glorification, as is due to Your eternal face\nالْبَقَاءُ السَّرْمَدِيِّ، وَكَمَا جَعَلْتَ نَبِيِّنَا خَيْرَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nALBAQAAA-US SARMADIYYE WA KAMAA JA-A’LTA NABIYYENAA KHAYRAN NABIYYEENA\nThe everlasting permanence, and as You made our Prophet the best of prophets\nوَمُلُوكَنَا اَفْضَلَ الْمخْلُوقِيْنَ، وَاخْتَرْتَهٗمْ عَلىٰ عِلْمٍ عَلَى الْعٰلَمِيْنَ\nWA MOLOOKANAA AFZALAL MAKHLOOQEENA WAKH TARTAHUM A’LAA I’LMIN A’LAL A’ALAMEENA\nAnd our kings the best of creation, and chose them with knowledge above all the worlds\nوَفِّقْنَا لِلسَّعْيِ الىٰ أبْوَابِهٖمُ الْعَامِرَةِ اِلى يَوْمِ الدِّيْنِ\nWAFFIQNAA LIS-SA’YE ELAA ABWAABEHEMUL A’AMERATE ELAA YAWMID DEENE\nAnd grant us success to strive towards their prosperous doors until the Day of Judgment\nوَاجْعَلْ أرْوَاحَنَا تَحِنُّ الىٰ مَوْطِنِ أقْدَامِهِمْ\nWAJ A’L ARWAAHANAA TAHINNO ELAA MAWTENE AQDAAMEHIM\nAnd make our souls yearn for the place of their feet\nوَنُفُوسَنَا تَهْوَى النَّظَرَ الىٰ مَجَالِسِهِمْ وَعَرَصَاتِهِمْ\nWA NOFOOSANAA TAHWAN NAZARA ELAA MAJAALESEHIM WA A’RASAATEHIM\nAnd our hearts long to look at their gatherings and courtyards\nحَتّٰى كَاْنَّنَا نُخَاطِبُهُمْ فِىْ حُضُوْرِ أشخَاصِهِمْ\nHATTAA KAANNANAA NOKHAATEBOHUM FEE HOZOORE ASHKHAASEHIM\nUntil it is as if we are addressing them in their presence\nفَصَلَّى اللهُ عَلَهِمْ مِنْ سَادَةٍ غَائِبِيْنَ، وَمِنْ سُلَالَةٍ طَاهِرِيْنَ\nFASALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHIM MIN SAADATIN GHAAA-EBEENA WA MIN SOLAALATIN TAAHEREENA\nSo may Allah send blessings upon them, noble ones who are absent, and from a pure lineage\nوَمِنْ أئِمَّةٍ مَعْصُومِيْنَ\nWA MIN A-IMMATIM MA’SOOMEENA\nAnd from infallible leaders\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَاْذَنْ لَنَا بِدُخُولِ هٰذِهِ الْعَرَصَاتِ\nALLAAHUMMA FAAZAL LANAA BE-DOKHOOLE HAAZEHIL A’RASAATE\nO Allah, permit us to enter these courtyards\nالَّتِيْ اسْتَعْبَدْتَ بِزِيَارَتِهَا أهْلَ الْأرَضِيْنَ وَالسَّمٰوَاتِ\nALLATIS TA’BADTA BE-ZEYAARATEHAA AHLAL ARAZEENA WAS SAMAAWAATE\nWhich You made the people of the earth and heavens worship by visiting\nوَاَرْسِلْ دُمُوعَنَا بِخُشُوعِ الْمَهَابَةِ\nWA ARSIL DOMOO-A’NAA BE-KHOSHOO-I’L MAHAABATE\nAnd send our tears with the humility of awe\nوذَلِّلْ جَوَارِحَنَا بِذُلِّ الْعُبُودِيَّةِ، وَفَرْضِ الطَّاعَةِ\nWA ZALLIL JAWAAREHANAA BEZULLIL O’BOODIYYATE WA FARZIT TAA-A’TE\nAnd subdue our limbs with the humility of servitude and the obligation of obedience\nحَتّٰى نُقِرَّ بِمَا يَجِبُ لَهٗمْ مِنَ الْأعْرَافِ\nHATTAA NOQIRRA BEMAA YAJEBO LAHUM MENAL A-A’RAAFE\nUntil we acknowledge what is due to them of rights\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ، وَسَلَامٌ عَلىٰ عِبَادِهِ الَّذِيْنَ اصْطَفٰى\nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE WA SALAAMUN A’LAA E’BAADEHIL LAZEENAS TAFAA\nAnd praise be to Allah, and peace upon His chosen servants\nمُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nMOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA\nMuhammad and his pure family\nاِلٰهِىْ اِنِّىْ وَقَفْتُ عَلىٰ بَابِ بَيْتٍ مِنْ بُيُوتِ نَبِيِّكَ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهٖ\nELAAHEE INNEE WAQAFTO A’LAA BAABE BAYTIM MIN BOYOOTE NABIYYEKA MOHAMMADIN SALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nO my God, I have stood at the door of a house from the houses of Your Prophet Muhammad, peace be upon him and his family\nوَقَدْ مَنَعْتَ النَّاسَ مِنَ الدُّخُوْلِ الىٰ بُيُوتِهٖ اِلَّا بِاِذْنِنهِ\nWA QAD MANA’TAN NAASA MENAD DOKHOOLE ELAA BOYOOTEHI ILLAA BE-IZNEHI\nAnd You have prevented people from entering his houses except with his permission\nفَقُلْتَ: ’يَا اَيُّهَا الَّذِيْنَ آمَنُوا لَا تَدْخُلُوا بُيُوتَ النَّبِيِّ اِلَّا أنْ يُؤْذَنَ لَكُمْ‘\nFAQULTA YAA AYYOHAL LAZEENA AAMANOO LAA TADKHOLOO BOYOOTAN NABIYYE ILLAA AN-Y YOAZANA LAKUM\nSo You said: \"O you who believe! Do not enter the houses of the Prophet unless permission is given to you.\"\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَانِىْ أعْتَقِدُ حُرْمَةَ نَبِيِّكَ فِىْ غَيْبَتِهٖ، كَمَا أعْتِقِدُ فِىْ حَضْرَتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA WA INNEE A-A’TAQEDO HURMATA NABIYYEKA FEE GHAYBATEHI KAMAA A-A’TAQEDO FEE HAZRATEHI\nO Allah, I believe in the sanctity of Your Prophet in his absence, just as I do in his presence\nوَأعْلَمُ أنَّ رُسُلَكَ وَخُلَفَائَكَ أحْيَاءٌ عِنْدَكَ يُرْزَقُونَ، فَرِحِيْنَ\nWA A-A’LAMO ANNA ROSOLAKA WA KHOLAFAAA-AKA AHYAAA-UN I’NDAKA YURZAQOONA FAREHEENA\nAnd I know that Your Messengers and successors are alive with You, provided for, rejoicing\nيَرَوْنَ مَكَانِىْ وَيَسْمَعُونَ كَلَامِىْ وَيَرُدُّونَ سَلَامِىْ عَلَيَّ\nYARAWNA MAKAANEE WA YASMA-O’ONA KALAAMEE WA YARUDDOONA SALAAMEE A’LAYYA\nThey see my place, hear my words, and return my greetings to me\nوَأنَّكَ حَجَبْتَ عَنْ سَمْعِىْ كَلَامَهُمْ وَفَتَحْتَ بَابَ فَهْمِىْ بِلَذِيْذِ مُنَاجَاتِهِمْ\nWA ANNAKA HAJABTA A’N SAM-E’E KALAAMAHUM WA FATAHTA BAABA FAHMEE BE-LAZEEZE MONAAJAATEHIM\nAnd that You have veiled their speech from my hearing, but opened the door of my understanding to the sweetness of their intimate prayers\nفَاِنِّيْ اَسْتَاْذِنُكَ يَا رَبِّ أوَ لاً، وَأسْتَاْذِنُ رَسُولَكَ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهٖ ثَانِياً\nFA-INNEE ASTAAZENOKA YAA RABBE AWWALANW WA ASTAAZENO RASOOLAKA SALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA AALEHI SAANEYAN\nSo I seek Your permission, O my Lord, first, and I seek the permission of Your Messenger, peace be upon him and his family, second\nوَاَسْتَاْذِنُ خَلِيْفَتَكَ الْاِمَامَ الْمُفْتَرَضَ عَلَيَّ طَاعَتُهٗ فِي الدُّخُولِ فِىْ سَاعَتِىْ هٰذِهِ الىٰ بَيْتِهٖ\nWA ASTAAZENO KHALEEFATAKAL EMAAMAL MUFTARAZA A’LAYYA TAA-A’TOHU FID DOKHOOLE FEE SAA-A’TEE HAAZEHI ELAA BAYTEHI\nAnd I seek the permission of Your successor, the Imam whose obedience is obligatory upon me, to enter his house at this moment\nوَأسْتَاْذِنُ مَلَائِكَتَكَ الْمُوَكَّلِيْنَ بِهٰذِهِ الْبُقْعَةِ الْمُبَارَكَةِ، اَلْمُطِيْعَةِ لَكَ السَّامِعَةِ\nWA ASTAAZENO MALAAA-EKATAKAL MOWAKKALEENA BE-HAAZEHIL BUQ-A’TIL MOBAARAKATE ALMOTEE-A’TE LAKAS SAAME-A’TE\nAnd I seek the permission of Your angels assigned to this blessed spot, obedient and attentive to You\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَيَّتُهَا الْمَلَائِكَةُ الْمُوَكَّلُونَ بِهٰذَا الْمَشْهَدِ الشَّرِيْفِ الْمُبَارَكِ، وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM AYYATOHAL MALAAA-EKATUL MOWAKKALOONA BE-HAAZAL MASH-HADISH SHAREEFIL MOBAARAKE WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nPeace be upon you, O angels assigned to this noble, blessed sanctuary, and the mercy and blessings of Allah\nبِاذْنِ اللهِ وَاِذْنِ رَسُولِهٖ وَاذْنِ خُلَفَائِهٖ هٰذا الاِمَامِ، وَبِاذِنِكُمْ صَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nBE-IZNIL LAAHE WA IZNE RASOOLEHI WA IZNE KHOLAFAAA-EHI HAAZAL EMAAME WA BE-IZNEKUM SALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYKUM AJMA-E’ENA\nBy Allah’s permission, and the permission of His Messenger and His successors, and by your permission, may Allah’s blessings be upon you all\nأدْخُلُ هٰذا الْبَيْتَ مُتَقَرِّباً اِلَى اللهِ بِاللهِ وَرَسُولِهٖ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nADKHOLO HAAZAL BAYTA MOTAQARREBAN ELAL LAAHE BILLAAHE WA RASOOLEHI MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA\nI enter this house seeking nearness to Allah, by Allah and His Messenger Muhammad and his pure family\nفَكُونُوا مَلَائِكَةَ اللهِ أعْوَانِىْ، وَكُونُوا أنْصَارِيْ حَتّٰى أدْخُلَ هٰذَا الْبَيْتَ\nFAKOONOO MALAAA-EKATAL LAAHE A-A’WAANEE WA KOONOO ANSAAREE HATTAA ADKHOLA HAAZAL BAYTA\nSo be, O angels of Allah, my helpers, and my supporters until I enter this house\nوَأدْعُوَا اللهَ بِفُنُونِ الدَّعَوَاتِ، وَأعْتَرِفَ لِلّٰهِ بِالْعُبُودِيَّةِ، وَلِهٰذَا الْاِمَامِ وَآبَائِهٖ\nWA AD-O’WAL LAAHA BE-FONOONID DA-A’WAATE WA A-A’TAREFA LILLAAHE BIL-O’BOODIYYATE WA LE-HAAZAL EMAAME WA AABAAA-EHI\nAnd I will call upon Allah with various supplications, and confess servitude to Allah, and to this Imam and his forefathers\nصَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَيْهِمْ - بِالطَّاعَةِ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYHIM BIT-TAA-A’TE\nMay Allah’s blessings be upon them – with obedience\n**When entering, place your right foot first and say:**\nبِسْمِ اللهِ وَبِاللهِ، وَفِىْ سَبِيْلِ اللهِ وَعَلىٰ مِلَّةِ رَسُولِ اللهِ\nBISMIL LAAHE WA BILLAAHE WA FEE SABEELIL LAAHE WA A’LAA MILLATE RASOOLIL LAAHE\nIn the name of Allah and by Allah, in the way of Allah and upon the creed of the Messenger of Allah\nI bear witness that there is no god but Allah, alone, without partner, and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and\nأشْهَدُ اَنْ لَا اِلٰهَ الَا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ، وَأشْهَدُ أنَّ مُحَمَّداً عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُولُهُ\nASH-HADO AL LAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU WA ASH-HADO ANNA MOHAMMADAN A’BDOHU WA RASOOLOHU\nI bear witness that there is no god but Allah, alone, without partner, and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger\n**Then say:**\nاَللهُ اَكْبَرُ\nALLAAHO AKBARO\nAllah is the Greatest\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE\nAll praise is due to Allah\nسُبْحَانَ اللهِ\nSUBHAANAL LAAHE\nGlory be to Allah\nلَا اِلهَ اِلَّا اللهُ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO\nThere is no god but Allah\n**After entering and facing the Qiblah, recite:**\nسَلَامُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ وَتَحِيَّاتُهٗ وَصَلَوَاتُهٗ عَلىٰ مَوْلَايَ صَاحِبِ الزَّمَانِ\nSALAAMUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU WA TAHIYYAATOHU WA SALAWAATOHU A’LAA MAWLAAYA SAAHEBIZ ZAMAANE\nAllah’s peace, blessings, greetings, and prayers be upon my master, the Master of the Age\nصَاحِبِ الضِّيَاءِ وَالنُّورِ، وَالدِّيْنِ الْمَاْثُورِ\nSAAHEBIZ ZEYAAA-E WAN NOORE WAD DEENIL MAASOORE\nMaster of light and radiance, and the inherited religion\nوَاللِّوَاءِ الْمَشْهُورِ، وَالْكِتَابِ الْمَنْشُورِ\nWAL LEWAAA-IL MASH-HOORE WAL KETAABIL MANSHOORE\nAnd the well-known banner, and the open Book\nوَصَاحِبِ الدُّهُورِ وَالْعُصُورِ، وَخَلَفِ الْحَسَنِ\nWA SAAHEBID DOHOORE WAL O’SOORE WA KHALAFIL HASANE\nAnd the master of ages and eras, and the successor of Hasan\nالْاِمَامِ الْمُؤْتَمَنِ، وَالْقَائِمِ الْمُعْتَمَدِ\nAL-EMAAMIL MOATAMANE WAL QAAA-EMIL MO’TAMADE\nThe trustworthy Imam, the reliable one who stands up\nوَالْمَنْصُورِ الْمُؤُيَّدِ، وَالْكَهْفِ وَالْعَضُدِ\nWAL MANSOORIL MO-UYYADE WAL KAHFE WAL A’ZODE\nThe supported and aided one, the refuge and the strong arm\nوَعِمَادِ الْاِسْلَامِ وَرُكْنِ الْاَنَامِ\nWA E’MAADIL ISLAAME WA RUKNIL ANAAME\nThe pillar of Islam and the support of all creation\nوَمِفْتَاحِ الْكَلَامِ، وَوَلِيِّ الْاَحْكَامِ\nWA MIFTAAHIL KALAAME WA WALIYYIL AHKAAME\nThe key to speech, and the guardian of the laws\nوَشَمْسِ الظَّلَامِ، وَبَدْرِ التَّمَامِ\nWA SHAMSIZ ZALAAME WA BADRIT TAMAAME\nThe sun in darkness, and the full moon\nوَنَضْرَةِ الْاَيَّامِ، وَصَاحِبِ الصَّمْصَامِ\nWA NAZRATIL AYYAAME WA SAAHEBIS SAMSAAME\nThe beauty of days, and the owner of the sword\nوَفَلَّاقِ الْهَامِ، وَالْبَحْرِ الْقَمْقَامِ\nWA FALLAAQIL HAAME WAL BAHRIL QAMQAAME\nThe splitter of heads, and the roaring sea\nوَالسَّيِّدِ الْهُمَامِ وَحُجَّةِ الْخِصَامِ\nWAS SAYYEDIL HOMAAME WA HUJJATIL KHESAAME\nThe noble master and the proof in disputes\nوَبَابِ الْمَقَامِ لِيَوْمِ الْقِيَامِ\nWA BAABIL MAQAAME LE-YAWMIL QEYAAME\nThe gate of standing for the Day of Resurrection\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلىٰ مُفَرِّجِ الْكُرُبَاتِ، وَخَوَّاضِ الْغَمَرَاتِ\nWAS SALAAMO A’LAA MOFARREJIL KOROBAATE WA KHAWWAAZIL GHAMARAATE\nAnd peace be upon the reliever of distresses, and the one who braves the depths\nوَمُنّفِّسِ الْحَسَرَاتِ، وَبَقِيَّةِ اللهِ فِىْ أرْضِهٖ\nWA MONAFFESIL HASARAATE WA BAQIYYATIL LAAHE FEE ARZEHI\nAnd the reliever of sorrows, and the remainder of Allah on His earth\nوَصَاحِبِ فَرْضِهٖ، وَحُجَّتِهٖ عَلىٰ خَلْقِهٖ\nWA SAAHEBE FARZEHI WA HUJJATEHI A’LAA KHALQEHI\nAnd the one with His duty, and His proof over His creation\nوَعَيْبَةِ عِلْمِهٖ، وَمَوْضِعِ صِدْقِهٖ\nWA A’YBATE I’LMEHI WA MAWZE-E’ SIDQEHI\nAnd the repository of His knowledge, and the place of His truthfulness\nوَالْمُنْتَهٰى الَيْهِ مَوَارِيْثُ الْاَنْبِيَاءِ\nWAL MUNTAHAA ELAYHE MAWAAREESUL ANBEYAAA-E\nAnd the one to whom the inheritances of the prophets end\nوَلَدَيْهِ مَوْجُودٌ آثَارُ الْاَوْصِيَاءِ\nWA LADAYHE MAWJOODUN AASAARUL AWSEYAAA-E\nAnd with him are found the relics of the successors\nوَحُجَّةِ اللهِ وَابْنِ رَسُولِهٖ، وَالْقَيِّمِ مَقَامَهٗ\nWA HUJJATIL LAAHE WABNE RASOOLEHI WAL QAYYEME MAQAAMAHU\nAnd the proof of Allah and the son of His Messenger, and the one who stands in his place\nوَوَلِيَّ أمْرِ اللهِ، وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA WALIYYA AMRIL LAAHE WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAnd the guardian of Allah’s command, and the mercy and blessings of Allah\nاَللّٰهُمَّ كَمَا انْتَجَبْتَهٗ لِعِلْمِكَ، وَاصْطَفَيْتَهٗ لِحُكْمِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA KAMAN TAJABTAHU LE-I’LMEKA WAS TAFAYTAHU LE-HUKMEKA\nO Allah, just as You selected him for Your knowledge, and chose him for Your rule\nوَخَصَصْتَهٗ بِمَعْرِفَتِكَ، وَاخْتَرْتَهٗ لِنَفْسِكَ\nWA KHASASTAHU BE-MA’REFATEKA WAKH TARTAHU LE-NAFSEKA\nAnd You granted him Your knowledge, and chose him for Yourself\nوَغشَّيْتَهٗ بِرَحْمَتِكَ، وَرَبَّيْتَهٗ بِنِعْمَتِكَ\nWA GHASHSHAYTAHU BE-RAHMATEKA WA RABBAYTAHU BE-NE’MATEKA\nAnd You covered him with Your mercy, and nurtured him with Your blessings\nوَغَذَّيْتَهٗ بِحِكْمَتِكَ، وَاخْتَرْتَهٗ لِنَفْسِكَ\nWA GHAZZAYTAHU BE-HIKMATEKA WAKH TARTAHU LE-NAFSEKA\nAnd You nourished him with Your wisdom, and chose him for Yourself\nوَاجْتَبَيْتَهٗ لِبأسِكَ، وَارْتَضَيْتَهٗ لِقُدْسِكَ\nWAJ TABAYTAHU LE-BAASEKA WAR TAZAYTAHU LE-QUDSEKA\nAnd You selected him for Your might, and were pleased with him for Your holiness\nوَجَعَلْتَهٗ هَادِياً لِمَنْ شِئْتَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ\nWA JA-A’LTAHU HAADEYAL LEMAN SHEATA MIN KHALQEKA\nAnd You made him a guide for whomever You will among Your creation\nوَدَيَّانَ الدِّيْنَ بِعَدْلِكَ، وَفَصْلَ الْقَضَايَا بَيْنَ عِبَادِكَ\nWA DAYYAANAD DEENA BE-A’DLEKA WA FASLAL QAZAAYAA BAYNA E’BAADEKA\nAnd the judge of the religion by Your justice, and the one who settles disputes among Your servants\nوَوَعَدْتَهٗ أنْ تَجْمَعَ بِهِ الْكَلِمَ، وَتُفَرِّجَ بِهٖ عَنِ الْاُمَمِ\nWA WA-A’DTAHU AN TAJMA-A’ BEHIL KALEMA WA TOFARREJA BEHI A’NIL OMAME\nAnd You promised him to unite the word through him, and to relieve the nations through him\nوَتُنِيْرَ بِعَدْلِهِ الظُّلَمِ، وَتُطْفِيءَ بِهٖ نِيْرَانَ الظُّلْمِ\nWA TONEERA BE-A’DLEHIZ ZOLAME WA TUTFEE-A BEHI NEERAANAZ ZULME\nAnd to illuminate the darkness with his justice, and to extinguish the fires of oppression through him\nوَتَقْمَعَ بِهٖ حَرَّ الْكُفْرِ وَآثَارَهٗ، وَتُطَهِّرَ بِهٖ بِلَادَكَ\nWA TAQMA-A’ BEHI HARRAL KUFRE WA AASAARAHU WA TOTAHHERA BEHI BELAADAKA\nAnd to suppress the heat of disbelief and its traces, and to purify Your lands through him\nوَتَشْفِىْ بِهٖ صُدُورَ عِبَادِكَ، وَتَجْمَعَ بِهِ الْمَمَالِكَ كُلَّهَا\nWA TASHFEE BEHI SODOORA E’BAADEKA WA TAJMA-A’ BEHIL MAMAALEKA KULLAHAA\nAnd to heal the hearts of Your servants through him, and to gather all the kingdoms through him\nقَرِيْبَهَا وَبَعِيْدَهَا، عَزِيْزَهَا وَذَلِيْلَهَا\nQAREEBAHAA WA BA-E’EDAHAA A’ZEEZAHAA WA ZALEELAHAA\nWhether near or far, mighty or humble\nشَرْقَهَا وَغَرْبَهَا، سَهْلَهَا وَجَبَلَهَا\nSHARQAHAA WA GHARBAHAA SAHLAHAA WA JABALAHAA\nEast and west, plain and mountain\nصَبَاهَا وَدَبُورَهَا شِمَالَهَا وَجُنُوبَهَا\nSABAAHAA WA DABOORAHAA SHEMAALAHAA WA JONOOBAHAA\nIts east wind and west wind, north and south\nبَرَّهَا وَبَحْرَهَا، حُزُوْنَهَا وَوُعُوررَهَا\nBARRAHAA WA BAHRAHAA HOZOONAHAA WA WO-O’ORRAHAA\nIts land and sea, its hills and valleys\nيَمْلاُهَا، قِسْطاً وَعَدْلاً كَمَا مُلِئَتْ ظُلْماً وَجَوْراً\nYAMLA-OHAA QISTANW WA A’DLAN KAMAA MOLE-AT ZULMANW WA JAWRAN\nHe will fill it with justice and equity as it was filled with oppression and injustice\nوَتُمَكَّنَ لَهٗ فِيْهَا وَتُنْجِزَ بِهٖ وَعْدَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nWA TOMAKKANA LAHU FEEHAA WA TUNJEZA BEHI WA’DAL MOAMENEENA\nAnd You will establish him in it and fulfill the promise to the believers through him\nحَتّٰى لَا يَسْتَخْفِيَ بِشَيْءٍ مِنَ الْحَقِّ، مَخَافَةَ اَحَدٍ مِنَ الْخَلْقِ\nHATTAA LAA YASTAKHFEYA BE-SHAY-IM MENAL HAQQE MAKHAAFATA AHADIM MENAL KHALQE\nUntil nothing of the truth is hidden out of fear of anyone from creation\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَيْهِ صَلَاةً تُظْهِرُ بِهَا حُجَّتَهٗ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAYHE SALAATAN TUZHERO BEHAA HUJJATAHU\nO Allah, send blessings upon him—a blessing that manifests his proof\nوَتُوضِحُ بِهَا بَهْجَتَهٗ، وَتَرْفَعُ بِهَا دَرَجَتَهٗ\nWA TOOZEHO BEHAA BAHJATAHU WA TARFA-O’ BEHAA DARAJATAHU\nAnd clarifies his splendor, and raises his rank\nوَتُؤَيِّدُ بِهَا سُلْطَانَهٗ، وَتُعَظِّمُ بِهَا بُرْهَانَهٗ\nWA TO-AYYEDO BEHAA SULTAANAHU WA TO-A’ZZEMO BEHAA BURHAANAHU\nAnd supports his authority, and magnifies his evidence\nوَتُشَرِّفُ بِهَا مَكَانَهٗ، وَتُعْلِىْ بِهَا بُنْيَانَهٗ\nWA TOSHARREFO BEHAA MAKAANAHU WA TO’LEE BEHAA BUNYAANAHU\nAnd honors his position, and elevates his foundation\nوَتُعِزُّ بِهَا نَصْرَهٗ، وَتَرْفَعُ بِهَا قَدْرَهٗ\nWA TO-I’ZZO BEHAA NASRAHU WA TARFA-O’ BEHAA QADRAHU\nAnd grants victory through him, and raises his esteem\nوَتُسَمِّيْ بِهَا ذِكْرَهٗ، وَتُظْهِرُ بِهَا كَلِمَتَهٗ\nWA TOSAMMEE BEHAA ZIKRAHU WA TUZHERO BEHAA KALEMATAHU\nAnd makes his remembrance renowned, and makes his word manifest\nوَتُكْثِرُ بِهَا نُصْرَتَهٗ، وَتُعِزُّ بَهَا دَعْوَتَهٗ\nWA TUKSERO BEHAA NUSRATAHU WA TO-I’ZZO BEHAA DA’WATAHU\nAnd multiplies his support, and strengthens his call\nوَتَزِيْدُهٗ بِهَا اِكْرَامًا وَتَجْعَلُهٗ لِلْمُتَّقِيْنَ اِمَامًا\nWA TAZEEDOHU BEHAA IKRAAMANW WA TAJ-A’LOHU LILMUTTAQEENA EMAAMAN\nAnd increases his honor, and makes him an Imam for the God-conscious\nوَتُبَلِّغُهٗ فِىْ هٰذا الْمَكَانِ، مِثْلَ هٰذَا الْاَوَانِ\nWA TOBALLEGHOHU FEE HAAZAL MAKAANE MISLA HAAZAL AWAANE\nAnd grant him in this place, at this time\nوَفِىْ كُلِّ مَكَانٍ وَاَوَانٍ، مِنَّا تَحِيَّةً وَسَلَاماً\nWA FEE KULLE MAKAANINW WA AWAANIM MINNAA TAHIYYATANW WA SALAAMAN\nAnd in every place and time, from us, greetings and peace\nلَا يَبْلىٰ جَدِيْدُهٗ، وَلَا يَفْنىٰ عَدِيْدُهٗ\nLAA YABLAA JADEEDOHU WA LAA YAFNAA A’DEEDOHU\nWhose newness never wears out, nor does its number end\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَقِيَّةَ اللهِ فِىْ أرْضِهٖ وَبِلَادِهٖ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAQIYYATAL LAAHE FEE ARZEHI WA BELAADEHI\nPeace be upon you, O remainder of Allah on His earth and in His lands\nوَحُجَّتَهٗ عَلىٰ عِبَادِهٖ\nWA HUJJATAHU A’LAA E’BAADEHI\nAnd His proof over His servants\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَلَفَ السَّلَفِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHALAFAS SALAFE\nPeace be upon you, O successor of the predecessors\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ الشَّرَفِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAAHEBASH SHARAFE\nPeace be upon you, O possessor of honor\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ الْمْعْبُودِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL MA’BOODE\nPeace be upon you, O proof of the Worshipped One\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا كَلِمَةَ الْمحْمُودِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KALEMATAL MAHMOODE\nPeace be upon you, O word of the Praised One\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا شَمْسَ الشُّمُوسِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SHAMSASH SHOMOOSE\nPeace be upon you, O sun of all suns\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَهْدِيَّ الْاَرْضِ، وَمُبَيَّنَ عَيْنِ الْفَرْضِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAHDIYYAL ARZE WA MOBAYYANA A’YNIL FARZE\nPeace be upon you, O guided one of the earth, and clarifier of obligations\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ يَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ وَالْعَالِي الشَّاْنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAAYA YAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAANE WAL A’ALISH SHAANE\nPeace be upon you, my master, O master of the time and of high status\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَاتِمَ الْاَوْصِيَاءِ وَابْنَ خَاتِمِ الْاَنْبِيَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHAATEMAL AWSEYAAA-E WABNA KHAATEMIL ANBEYAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O seal of the successors and son of the seal of the prophets\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُعِزَّ الْاَوْلِيَاءِ وَمُذِلَّ الْاْعْدَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MO-I’ZZAL AWLEYAAA-E WA MOZILLAL A-A’DAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O honor-giver to the saints and humbler of enemies\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْوَحِيْدُ، وَالْقَائِمُ الرَّشِيْدُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL WAHEEDO WAL QAAA-EMUR RASHEEDO\nPeace be upon you, O unique Imam, and the rightly guided one who rises\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْفَرِيْدُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL FAREEDO\nPeace be upon you, O singular Imam\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْمُنْتَظَرُ، وَالْحَقُّ الْمُشْتَهَرُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL MUNTAZARO WAL HAQQUL MUSHTAHARO\nPeace be upon you, O awaited Imam, and the manifest truth\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْوَلِيُّ الْمُجْتَبىٰ، وَالْحَقُّ الْمُنْتَهىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL WALIYYUL MUJTABAA WAL HAQQUL MUNTAHAA\nPeace be upon you, O chosen guardian Imam, and the ultimate truth\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْمُرْتَجىٰ لِازَالَةِ الْجَوْرِ وَالْعُدوَانِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL MURTAJAA LE-EZAALATIL JAWRE WAL U’DWAANE\nPeace be upon you, O hoped-for Imam for removing injustice and aggression\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْمُبِيْدُ لِاَهْلِ الْفُسُوقِ وَالطُّغْيَانِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL MOBEEDO LE-AHLIL FOSOOQE WAT TUGHYAANE\nPeace be upon you, O Imam who destroys the wicked and tyrants\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْهَادِمُ لِبُنْيَانِ الشِّرْكِ وَالنِّفَاقِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL HAADEMO LE-BUNYAANISH SHIRKE WAN NEFAAQE\nPeace be upon you, O Imam who demolishes the structures of polytheism and hypocrisy\nوَالْحَاصِدُ فُرُوعَ الْغَيِّ وَالشِّقَاقِ\nWAL HAASEDO FOROO-A’L GHAYYE WASH SHEQAAQE\nAnd the reaper of the branches of error and discord\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ أيُّهَا الْمُدَّخَرُ لِتَجْدِيْدِ الْفَرَائضِ وَالسُّنَنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MUDDAKHARO LE-TAJDEEDIL FARAAA-EZE WAS SONANE\nPeace be upon you, O stored one for renewing obligations and traditions\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا طَامِسَ آثَارِ الزَّيْغِ وَالْاَهْوَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA TAAMESA AASAARIZ ZAYGHE WAL AHWAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O eraser of the traces of deviation and desires\nوَقَاطِعَ حبَائِلِ الْكَذِبِ وَالْفِتَنِ وَالْاِمْتِرَاءِ\nWA QAATE-A’ HABAAA-ELIL KAZEBE WAL FETANE WAL IMTERAAA-E\nAnd the cutter of the snares of lies, seditions, and doubts\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ أيُّهَا الْمُؤَمَّلُ لِاحْيَاءِ الدَّوْلَةِ الشَّرِيْفَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MO-AMMALO LE-EHYAAA-ID DAWLATISH SHAREEFATE\nPeace be upon you, O hoped-for one for reviving the noble state\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا جَامِعَ الْكَلِمَةِ عَلَى التَّقْوىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA JAAME-A’L KALEMATE A’LAT TAQWAA\nPeace be upon you, O uniter of the word upon piety\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَابَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAABAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O gate of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ثَارَ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAARAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O vengeance of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُحْيِيَ مَعَالِمِ الدِّيْنِ وَأهْلِهٖ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MOHYEYA MA-A’ALEMID DEENE WA AHLEHI\nPeace be upon you, O reviver of the landmarks of religion and its people\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا قَاصِمَ شَوْكَةِ الْمُعْتَدِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA QAASEMA SHAWKATIL MO’TADEENA\nPeace be upon you, O breaker of the thorns of the aggressors\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَجْهَ اللهِ الَّذِىْ لَا يَهْلِكُ وَلَا يَبْلىٰ الىٰ يَوْمِ الدِّيْنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAJHAL LAAHIL LAZEE LAA YAHLEKO WA LAA YABLAA ELAA YAWMID DEENE\nPeace be upon you, O Face of Allah who neither perishes nor fades until the Day of Judgment\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رُكْنَ الْاِيْمَانِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA RUKNAL EEMAANE\nPeace be upon you, O pillar of faith\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ أيُّهَا السَّبَبُ الْمُتَّصِلُ بَيْنَ الْأرْضِ وَالسَّمَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAS SABABUL MUTTASELO BAYNAL ARZE WAS SAMAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O the connecting cause between earth and sky\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ الْفَتْحِ وَنَاشِرَ رَايَةِ الْهُدىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAAHEBAL FAT-HE WA NAASHERA RAAYATIL HODAA\nPeace be upon you, O possessor of victory and spreader of the banner of guidance\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُؤَلِّفُ شَمْلِ الصَّلَاحِ وَالرِّضا\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MO-ALLEFO SHAMLIS SALAAHE WAR REZAA\nPeace be upon you, O uniter of the bonds of righteousness and contentment\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا طَالِبَ ثَارِ الْاَنْبِيَاءِ، وَأبْنَاءِ الْأنْبِيَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA TAALEBA SAARIL ANBEYAAA-E WA ABNAAA-IL ANBEYAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O avenger of the Prophets and sons of the Prophets\nوَالثَّائِرَ بِدَمِ الْمَقْتُولِ بِكَرْبَلَاءَ\nWAS SAAA-ERA BE-DAMIL MAQTOOLE BE-KARBALAAA-A\nAnd the one who revolts for the blood of the slain in Karbala\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ أيُّهَا الْمَنْصُورُ عَلىٰ مَنِ اعْتَدىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MANSOORO A’LAA MANE’TADAA\nPeace be upon you, O the victorious over those who transgress\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ أيُّهَا الْمُضْطَرُّ الْمُجَابُ اِذَا دَعَا\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MUZTARRUL MOJAABO EZAA DA-A’A\nPeace be upon you, O the distressed one whose prayer is answered\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بِقِيَّةَ الْخَلَائِفِ، الْبَرُّ التَّقِيُّ، الْبَاقِىْ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAQIYYATAL KHALAAA-EFIL BARRUT TAQIYYUL BAAQEE\nPeace be upon you, O remainder of the Caliphs, the pious and enduring\nلِازَالَةِ الْجَوْرِ وَالْعُدْوَانِ\nLE-EZAALATIL JAWRE WAL U’DWAANE\nFor the removal of injustice and aggression\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ النَّبِيِّ الْمُصْطَفىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAN NABIYYIL MUSTAFAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the chosen Prophet\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ عَلِيٍّ الْمُرْتَضىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA A’LIYYENIL MURTAZAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of Ali the chosen one\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O son of Fatimah az-Zahra\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ خَدِيْجَةَ الْكُبْرىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA KHADEEJATAL KUBRAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of Khadijah the Great\nوَابْنَ السَّادَةِ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ، وَالْقَادَةِ الْمُتَّقِيْنَ\nWABNAS SAADATIL MOQARRABEENA WAL QAADATIL MUTTAQEENA\nAnd son of the noble and close ones, and leaders of the pious\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ النُّجَبَاءِ الْاَكْرَمِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAN NOJABAAA-IL AKRAMEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the noble and generous\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الَاصْفِيَاءِ الْمُهْتَدِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL ASFEYAAA-IL MOHTADEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the pure and guided\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْهُدَاةِ الْمَهْدِيِّيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL HODAATIL MAHDIYYEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the guides and rightly guided\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ خِيَرَةِ الْخَيْرِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA KHEYARATIL KHAYRE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the best of good\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ سَادَةِ الْبَشَرِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA SAADATIL BASHARE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the masters of mankind\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْغطَارِفَةِ الْاَكْرَمِيْنَ وَالْأطَائِبِ الْمُطَهَّرِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL GHATAAREFATIL AKRAMEENA WAL ATAAA-EBIL MOTAHHAREENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the noble and pure ones\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْبَرَرَةِ الْمُنْتَجَبِيْنَ، وَالْخَضَارِمَةِ الْاَنْجَبِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL BARARATIL MUNTAJABEENA WAL KHAZAAREMATIL ANJABEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the chosen righteous and noble\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْحُجَجِ الْمُنِيْرَةِ، وَالسُّرُجِ الْمُضِيْئَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL HOJAJIL MONEERATE WAS SOROJIL MOZEE-ATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the luminous proofs and shining lamps\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الشُّهُبِ الثَّاقِبَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNASH SHOHOBIS SAAQEBATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the piercing meteors\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ قَوَاعِدِ الْعِلْمِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA QAWAA-E’DIL I’LME\nPeace be upon you, O son of the foundations of knowledge\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ مَعَادِنِ الْحِلْمِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA MA-A’ADENIL HILME\nPeace be upon you, O son of the mines of forbearance\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْكَوَاكِبِ الزَّاهِرَةِ، وَالنُّجُومِ الْبَاهِرَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL KAWAAKEBIZ ZAAHERATE WAN NOJOOMIL BAAHERATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the shining stars and brilliant constellations\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الشُّمُوسِ الطَّالِعَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNASH SHOMOOSIT TAALE-A’TE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the rising suns\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْاَقْمَارِ السَّاطِعَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL AQMAARIS SAATE-A’TE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the shining moons\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ السُّبُلِ الْوَاضِحَةِ وَالْاَعْلَامِ اللَّائِحَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAS SOBOLIL WAAZEHATE WAL A-A’LAAMIL LAAA-EHATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the clear paths and waving flags\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ السُّنَنِ الْمَشْهُورَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAS SONANIL MASH-HOORATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the famous traditions\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْمَعَالِمِ الْمَاْثُورَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL MA-A’ALEMIL MAASOORATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the transmitted landmarks\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الشَّوَاهِدِ الْمَشْهُودَةِ وَالْمُعْجِزَاتِ الْمَوْجُودَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNASH SHAWAAHEDIL MASH-HOODATE WAL MO’JEZAATIL MAWJOODATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the witnessed signs and existing miracles\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الصِّرَاطِ الْمُسْتَقِيْمِ وَالنَّبَاءِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAS SERAATIL MUSTAQEEME WAN NABAAA-IL A’ZEEME\nPeace be upon you, O son of the straight path and the great news\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْآيَاتِ الْبَيِّنَاتِ وَالدَّلَائِلِ الظَّاهِرَاتِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL AAYAATIL BAYYENAATE WAD DALAAA-ELIZ ZAAHERAATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the clear signs and manifest proofs\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْبَرَاهِينِ الْوَاضِحَاتِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL BARAAHEENIL WAAZEHAATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the clear evidences\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ الْحُجَجِ الْبَالِغَاتِ وَالنِّعَمِ السَّابِغَاتِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL HOJAJIL BAALEGHAATE WAN NE-A’MIS SAABEGHAATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the conclusive proofs and abundant blessings\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ طٰهَ وَالْمُحْكَمَاتِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA TAAHA WAL MOHKAMAATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of Taha and the decisive verses\nوَيَا سِينَ وَالذَّارِيَاتِ، وَالطُّورِ وَالْعَادِيَاتِ\nWA YAA SEENA WAZ ZAAREYAATE WAT TOORE WAL A’ADEYAATE\nAnd O son of Sin, Adh-Dhariyat, At-Tur, and Al-‘Adiyat\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ مَنْ دَنَىٰ فَتَدَلَّىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA MAN DANAA FATADALLAA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the one who drew near and descended\nفَكَانَ قَابَ قَوْسَيْنِ اَوْ اَدْنَىٰ\nFAKAANA QAABA QAWSAYNE AW ADNAA\nSo he was within two bows’ length or nearer\nوَاقْتَرَبَ مِنَ الْعَلِيِّ الْاَعْلَىٰ\nWAQ TARABA MENAL A’LIYYIL A-A’LAA\nAnd approached the Most High\nلَيْتَ شِعْرِيْ اَيْنَ اسْتَقَرَّتْ بِكَ النَّوَىٰ\nLAYTA SHE’REE AYNAS TAQARRAT BEKAN NAWAA\nI wish I knew where the distance (of separation) has settled you\nاَمْ اَنْتَ بِوَادِي طُوَىٰ\nAM ANTA BE-WAADEE TOWAA\nOr are you in the valley of Tuwa\nعَزِيزٌ عَلَيَّ اَنْ اَرَى الْخَلْقَ وَلَا تُرَىٰ\nA’ZEEZUN A’LAYYA AN ARAL KHALQA WA LAA TORAA\nIt pains me that I see the creation but you are not seen\nوَلَا يُسْمَعُ لَكَ حَسِيسٌ وَلَا نَجْوَىٰ\nWA LAA YUSMA-O’ LAKA HASEESUNW WA LAA NAJWAA\nNor is any whisper or secret conversation heard from you\nعَزِيزٌ عَلَيَّ اَنْ يُرَى الْخَلْقُ وَلَا تُرَىٰ\nA’ZEEZUN A’LAYYA AN-Y YORAL KHALQO WA LAA TORAA\nIt pains me that the creation is seen but you are not\nعَزِيزٌ عَلَيَّ اَنْ تُحِيطَ بِكَ الْاَعْدَاءُ\nA’ZEEZUN A’LAYYA AN TOHEETA BEKAL A-A’DAAA-O\nIt pains me that enemies surround you\nبِنَفْسِيْ اَنْتَ مِنْ مُغَيَّبٍ مَا غَابَ عَنَّا\nBE-NAFSEE ANTA MIM MOGHAYYABIM MAA GHAABA A’NNAA\nMay my soul be ransomed for you, O hidden one who is never absent from us!\nبِنَفْسِيْ اَنْتَ مِنْ نَازِحٍ مَا نَزَحَ عَنَّا\nBE-NAFSEE ANTA MIN NAAZEHIM MAA NAZAHA A’NNAA\nMay my soul be ransomed for you, O distant one who is never far from us!\nوَنَحْنُ نَقُولُ: الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nWA NAHNO NAQOOLUL HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA\nAnd we say: Praise be to Allah, Lord of the worlds\nوَصَلَّى اللهُ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهٖ اَجْمَعِينَ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHI AJMA-E’ENA\nAnd may Allah’s blessings be upon Muhammad and all his family\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ كَاشِفُ الْكَرْبِ وَالْبَلْوَىٰ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTA KAASHEFUL KARBE WAL BALWAA\nO Allah, You are the remover of distress and affliction\nوَاِلَيْكَ نَشْكُو فَقْدَ نَبِيِّنَا\nWA ELAYKA NASHKOO FAQDA NABIYYENAA\nAnd to You we complain the loss of our Prophet\nوَغَيْبَةَ اِمَامِنَا وَابْنِ بِنْتِ نَبِيِّنَا\nWA GHAYBATA EMAAMENAA WABNE BINTE NABIYYENAA\nAnd the absence of our Imam, the son of the daughter of our Prophet\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاملأ بِهِ الْاَرْضَ قِسْطًا وَعَدْلًا\nALLAAHUMMA WAM LA-A BEHIL ARZA QISTANW WA A’DLAN\nO Allah, fill the earth with justice and equity through him\nكَمَا مُلِئَتْ ظُلْمًا وَجُورًا\nKAMAA MOLE-AT ZULMANW WA JOORAN\nAs it was filled with oppression and injustice\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاَهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AHLE BAYTEHI\nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and his family\nوَاَرِنَا سَيِّدَنَا وَصَاحِبَنَا وَاِمَامَنَا وَمَوْلَانَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ\nWA ARENAA SAYYEDANAA WA SAAHEBANAA WA EMAAMANAA WA MAWLAANAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAANE\nAnd show us our master, companion, Imam, and guardian, the Owner of the Time\nوَمَلْجَاَ اَهْلِ عَصْرِنَا\nWA MALJA-A AHLE A’SRENAA\nAnd refuge of the people of our era\nوَمَنْجَا اَهْلِ دَهْرِنَا\nWA MANJAA AHLE DAHRENAA\nAnd deliverer of the people of our time\nظَاهِرَ الْمَقَالَةِ\nZAAHERAL MAQAALATE\nManifest in speech\nوَضَاحِ الدَّلَالَةِ\nWA ZAAHID DALAALATE\nClear in guidance\nهَادِيًا مِنَ الضَّلَالَةِ\nHAADEYAM MENAZ ZALAALATE\nA guide from error\nمُنْقِذًا مِنَ الْجَهَالَةِ\nMUNQEZAM MENAL JAHAALATE\nA rescuer from ignorance\nوَاَظْهِرْ مَعَالِمَهٗ\nWA AZHIR MA-A’ALEMAHU\nAnd manifest his signs\nوَثَبِّتْ قَوَاعِدَهٗ\nWA SABBIT QAWAA-E’DAHU\nAnd establish his foundations\nوَاَعِزَّ نَصْرَهٗ\nWA A-I’ZZA NASRAHU\nAnd strengthen his victory\nوَاَطِلْ عُمْرَهٗ\nWA ATIL U’MRAHU\nAnd prolong his life\nوَاَبْسِطْ جَاهَهٗ\nWA ABSIT JAAHAHU\nAnd expand his prestige\nوَاَحْيِ اَمْرَهٗ\nWA AHYE AMRAHU\nAnd revive his cause\nوَاَظْهِرْ نُورَهٗ\nWA AZHIR NOORAHU\nAnd manifest his light\nوَقَرِّبْ بُعْدَهٗ\nWA QARRIB BO’DAHU\nAnd bring near his distance\nوَاَنْجِزْ وَعْدَهٗ\nWA ANJIZ WA’DAHU\nAnd fulfill his promise\nوَاَوْفِ عَهْدَهٗ\nWA AWFE A’HDAHU\nAnd keep his covenant\nوَزَيِّنِ الْاَرْضَ بِطُولِ بَقَائِهٖ\nWA ZAYYENIL ARZA BE-TOOLE BAQAAA-EHI\nAnd adorn the earth with the length of his existence\nوَدَوَامِ مُلْكِهٖ\nWA DAWAAME MULKEHI\nAnd the permanence of his kingdom\nوَعُلُوِّ ارْتِقَائِهٖ وَارْتِفَاعِهٖ\nWA O’LUWWIR TEQAAA-EHI WAR TEFAA-E’HI\nAnd the exaltation of his ascension and elevation\nوَاَنِرْ مَشَاهِدَهٗ\nWA ANIR MASHAAHEDAHU\nAnd illuminate his scenes\nوَثَبِّتْ قَوَاعِدَهٗ\nWA SABBIT QAWAA-E’DAHU\nAnd establish his foundations\nوَعَظِّمْ بُرْهَانَهٗ\nWA A’ZZIM BURHAANAHU\nAnd magnify his proof\nوَاَمِدَّ سُلْطَانَهٗ\nWA AMIDDA SULTAANAHU\nAnd extend his authority\nوَاَعْلِ مَكَانَهٗ\nWA A-A’LE MAKAANAHU\nAnd elevate his position\nوَقَوِّ اَرْكَانَهٗ\nWA QAWWE ARKAANAHU\nAnd strengthen his pillars\nوَاَرِنَا وَجْهَهٗ\nWA ARENAA WAJHAHU\nAnd show us his face\nوَاَوْضِحْ بَهْجَتَهٗ\nWA AWZEH BAHJATAHU\nAnd clarify his joy\nوَارْفَعْ دَرَجَتَهٗ\nWAR FA’ DARAJATAHU\nAnd raise his rank\nوَاَظْهِرْ كَلِمَتَهٗ\nWA AZHIR KALEMATAHU\nAnd manifest his word\nوَاَعِزَّ دَعْوَتَهٗ\nWA A-I’ZZA DA’WATAHU\nAnd honor his call\nوَاَعْطِهٖ سُؤْلَهٗ\nWA A-A’TEHI SOALAHU\nAnd grant him his request\nوَبَلِّغْهُ يَا رَبِّ مَاْمُولَهٗ\nWA BALLIGH-HO YAA RABBE MAAMOOLAHU\nAnd fulfill for him, O Lord, his hope\nوَشَرِّفْ مَقَامَهٗ\nWA SHARRIF MAQAAMAHU\nAnd honor his station\nوَعَظِّمْ اِكْرَامَهٗ\nWA A’ZZIM IKRAAMAHU\nAnd magnify his respect\nوَاَعِزَّ بِهِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWA A-I’ZZA BEHIL MOAMENEENA\nAnd honor the believers through him\nوَاَحْيِ بِهٖ سُنَنَ الْمُرْسَلِينَ\nWA AHYE BEHI SONANAL MURSALEENA\nAnd revive, through him, the traditions of the Messengers\nوَاَذِلَّ بِهِ الْمُنَافِقِينَ\nWA AZILLA BEHIL MONAAFEQEENA\nAnd humiliate, through him, the hypocrites\nوَاَهْلِكْ بِهِ الْجَبَّارِينَ\nWA AHLIK BEHIL JABBAAREENA\nAnd destroy, through him, the tyrants\nوَاكْفِهٖ بَغْيَ الْحَاسِدِينَ\nWAK FEHI BAGHYAL HAASEDEENA\nAnd protect him from the oppression of the envious\nوَاَعِذْهُ مِنْ شَرِّ الْكَائِدِينَ\nWA A-I’ZHO MIN SHARRIL KAAA-EDEENA\nAnd shield him from the evil of the schemers\nوَازْجُرْ عَنْهُ اِرَادَةَ الظَّالِمِينَ\nWAZ JUR A’NHO ERAADATAZ ZAALEMEENA\nAnd repel from him the will of the oppressors\nوَاَيِّدْهُ بِجُنُودٍ مِنَ الْمَلَائِكَةِ مُسَوِّمِينَ\nWA AYYID-HO BE-JONOODIM MENAL MALAAA-EKATE MOSAWWEMEENA\nAnd support him with armies of marked angels\nوَسَلِّطْهُ عَلَىٰ اَعْدَاءِ دِينِكَ اَجْمَعِينَ\nWA SALLIT-HO A’LAA A-A’DAAA-E DEENEKA AJMA-E’ENA\nAnd grant him power over all the enemies of Your religion\nوَاقْصِمْ بِهٖ كُلَّ جَبَّارٍ عَنِيدٍ\nWAQ SIM BEHI KULLA JABBAARIN A’NEEDIN\nAnd break, through him, every arrogant tyrant\nوَأخْمِدْ بِسَيْفِهٖ كُلَّ نَارٍ وَقِيْدٍ\nWA AKHMID BE-SAYFEHI KULLA NAARINW WA QEEDIN\nAnd extinguish, by his sword, every fire and chain\nوَاَنْفِذْ حُكْمَهٗ فِي كُلِّ مَكَانٍ\nWA ANFIZ HUKMAHU FEE KULLE MAKAANIN\nAnd execute his judgment everywhere\nوَاَقِمْ بِسُلْطَانِهٖ كُلَّ سُلْطَانٍ\nWA AQIM BE-SULTAANEHI KULLA SULTAANIN\nAnd uphold his authority over every ruler\nوَاَقْمِعْ بِهٖ عَبَدَةَ الْاَوْثَانِ\nWA AQME’ BEHI A’BADATAL AWSAANE\nAnd suppress, through him, the worshippers of idols\nوَشَرِّفْ بِهٖ اَهْلَ الْقُرْآنِ وَالْاِيمَانِ\nWA SHARRIF BEHI AHLAL QUR-AANE WAL EEMAANE\nAnd honor, through him, the people of the Quran and faith\nوَاَظْهِرْهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ الْاَدْيَانِ\nWA AZHIRHO A’LAA KULLIL ADYAANE\nAnd manifest him over all religions\nوَاكْبِتْ مَنْ عَادَاهُ\nWAK BIT MAN A’ADAAHO\nAnd suppress whoever opposes him\nوَاَذِلَّ مَنْ نَاوَاهُ\nWA AZILLA MAN NAAWAAHO\nAnd humiliate whoever contends with him\nوَاسْتَاْصِلْ مَنْ جَحَدَ حَقَّهٗ\nWAS TAASIL MAN JAHADA HAQQAHU\nAnd uproot whoever denies his right\nوَاَنْكَرَ صِدْقَهٗ\nWA ANKARA SIDQAHU\nAnd rejects his truth\nوَاسْتَهَانَ بِاَمْرِهٖ\nWAS TAHAANA BE-AMREHI\nAnd belittles his matter\nوَاَرَادَ اِخْمَادَ ذِكْرِهٖ\nWA ARAADA IKHMAADA ZIKREHI\nAnd seeks to extinguish his remembrance\nوَسَعَىٰ فِي اِطْفَاءِ نُورِهٖ\nWA SA-A’A FEE ITFAAA-E NOOREHI\nAnd strives to put out his light\nاَللّٰهُمَّ نَوِّرْ بِنُورِهٖ كُلَّ ظُلْمَةٍ\nALLAAHUMMA NAWWIR BE-NOOREHI KULLA ZULMATIN\nO Allah, illuminate every darkness with his light\nوَاكْشِفْ بِهٖ غُمَّةً\nWAK SHIF BEHI GHUMMATAN\nAnd remove every gloom through him\nوَقَدِّمْ اَمَامَهُ الرُّعْبَ\nWA QADDIM AMAAMAHUR RO’BA\nAnd place before him awe and fear\nوَثَبِّتْ بِهِ الْقَلْبَ\nWA SABBIT BEHIL QALBA\nAnd strengthen the heart through him\nوَاَقِمْ بِهٖ نُصْرَةَ الْحَرْبِ\nWA AQIM BEHI NUSRATAL HARBE\nAnd establish through him victory in battle\nوَاجْعَلْهُ الْقَائِمَ الْمُؤَمَّلَ\nWAJ A’LHUL QAAA-EMAL MO-AMMALA\nAnd make him the awaited one who rises\nوَالْوَصِيَّ الْمُفَضَّلَ\nWAL WASIYYAL MOFAZZALA\nAnd the preferred successor\nوَالْاِمَامَ الْمُنْتَظَرَ\nWAL EMAAMAL MUNTAZARA\nAnd the awaited Imam\nوَالْعَدْلَ الْمُخْتَبَرَ\nWAL A’DLAL MUKHTABARA\nAnd the tested justice\nوَامْلَاْ بِهِ الْاَرْضَ عَدْلًا وَقِسْطًا\nWAM LA-A BEHIL ARZA A’DLANW WA QISTAN\nAnd fill the earth with justice and equity through him\nكَمَا مُلِئَتْ جَوْرًا وَظُلْمًا\nKAMAA MOLE-AT JAWRANW WA ZULMAN\nAs it was filled with oppression and tyranny\nوَاَعِنْهُ عَلَىٰ مَا وَلَّيْتَهٗ وَاسْتَخْلَفْتَهٗ وَاسْتَرْعَيْتَهٗ\nWA A-I’NHO A’LAA MAA WALLAYTAHU WAS TAKHLAFTAHU WAS TAR-A’YTAHU\nAnd assist him in what You have entrusted him with, made him successor of, and cared for\nحَتَّى تُجْرِيَ حُكْمَهٗ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ حُكْمٍ\nHATTAA TUJREYA HUKMAHU A’LAA KULLE HUKMIN\nUntil he enforces his rule over every rule\nوَيَهْدِي بِحَقِّهٖ كُلَّ ضَلَالَةٍ\nWA YAHDEE BE-HAQQEHI KULLA ZALAALATIN\nAnd guides by his truth every misguidance\nوَاحْرُسْهُ اللّٰهُمَّ بِعَيْنِكَ الَّتِي لَا تَنَامُ\nWAH RUS-HUL LAAHUMMA BE-A’YNEKAL LATEE LAA TANAAMO\nAnd guard him, O Allah, with Your eye that never sleeps\nوَكُنْفِهٖ بِرُكْنِكَ الَّذِي لَا يُرَامُ\nWA KUNFEHI BE-RUKNEKAL LAZEE LAA YORAAMO\nAnd protect him with Your support that cannot be overcome\nوَاَعِزَّهٗ بِعِزِّكَ الَّذِي لَا يُضَامُ\nWA A-I’ZZAHU BE-I’ZZEKAL LAZEE LAA YOZAAMO\nAnd honor him with Your might that cannot be challenged\nوَاجْعَلْنِي يَا اِلٰهِي مِنْ عَدَدِهٖ وَمَدَدِهٖ\nWAJ A’LNEE YAA ELAAHEE MIN A’DADEHI WA MADADEHI\nAnd make me, O my God, among his followers and supporters\nوَاَنْصَارِهٖ وَاَعْوَانِهٖ وَاَرْكَانِهٖ\nWA ANSAAREHI WA A-A’WAANEHI WA ARKAANEHI\nAnd among his helpers, assistants, and pillars\nوَاَشْيَاعِهٖ وَاَتْبَاعِهٖ\nWA ASHYAA-E’HI WA ATBAA-E’HI\nAnd among his followers and disciples\nوَاَذِقْنِي طَعْمَ فَرْحَتِهٖ\nWA AZIQNEE TA’MA FARHATEHI\nAnd let me taste the joy of his happiness\nوَاَلْبِسْنِي ثَوْبَ بَهْجَتِهٖ\nWA ALBISNEE SAWBA BAHJATEHI\nAnd clothe me in the garment of his delight\nوَاَحْضِرْنِي مَعَهٗ لِبَيْعَتِهٖ وَتَاْكِيدِ عَقْدِهٖ\nWA AHZIRNEE MA-A’HU LE-BAY-A’TEHI WA TAAKEEDE A’QDEHI\nAnd bring me with him for his allegiance and confirmation of his covenant\nبَيْنَ الرُّكْنِ وَالْمَقَامِ\nBAYNAR RUKNE WAL MAQAAME\nBetween the Corner (Ka‘bah) and the Station (Maqam Ibrahim)\nعِنْدَ بَيْتِكَ الْحَرَامِ\nI’NDA BAYTEKAL HARAAME\nNear Your Sacred House\nوَوَفِّقْنِي يَا رَبِّ لِلْقِيَامِ بِطَاعَتِهٖ\nWA WAFFIQNEE YAA RABBE LILQEYAAME BE-TAA-A’TEHI\nAnd grant me success, O Lord, to obey him\nوَالْمَثْوَىٰ فِي خِدْمَتِهٖ\nWAL MASWAA FEE KHIDMATEHI\nAnd to dwell in his service\nوَالْمَكْثِ فِي دَوْلَتِهٖ\nWAL MAKSE FEE DAWLATEHI\nAnd to remain in his dominion\nوَاجْتِنَابِ مَعْصِيَتِهٖ\nWAJ TENAABE MA’SEYATEHI\nAnd to avoid disobeying him\nفَاِنْ تَوَفَّيْتَنِي اللّٰهُمَّ قَبْلَ ذٰلِكَ\nFA-IN TAWAFFAYTANIL LAAHUMMA QABLA ZAALEKA\nIf You take my soul before that\nفَاجْعَلْنِي يَا رَبِّ فِيْمَنْ يَكِرُّ فِي رَجْعَتِهٖ\nFAJ-A’LNEE YAA RABBE FEEMAN-Y YAKIRRO FEE RAJ-A’TEHI\nThen make me, O Lord, among those who rejoice in his return\nوَيَمْلِكُ فِي دَوْلَتِهٖ\nWA YAMLEKO FEE DAWLATEHI\nAnd who possess authority in his state\nوَيَتَمَكَّنُ فِي اَيَّامِهٖ\nWA YATAMAKKANO FEE AYYAAMEHI\nAnd who are empowered in his days\nوَيَسْتَظِلُّ تَحْتَ اَعْلَامِهٖ\nWA YASTAZILLO TAHTA A-A’LAAMEHI\nAnd who take shelter under his banners\nوَيُحْشَرُ فِي زُمْرَتِهٖ\nWA YOHSHARO FEE ZUMRATEHI\nAnd who are gathered in his company\nوَتَقَرُّ بِرُؤْيَتِهٖ\nWA TAQARRO BE-ROAYATEHI\nAnd who find peace in seeing him\nبِفَضْلِكَ وَاَحْسَانِكَ وَكَرَمِكَ وَامْتِنَانِكَ\nBE-FAZLEKA WA EHSAANEKA WA KARAMEKA WAM TENAANEKA\nBy Your grace, kindness, generosity, and bounty\nاِنَّكَ ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيمِ\nINNAKA ZUL FAZLIL A’ZEEME\nIndeed, You are the Possessor of great bounty\nوَالْمَنِّ الْقَدِيمِ\nWAL MANNIL QADEEME\nAnd eternal favor\nوَالْاِحْسَانِ الْكَرِيمِ\nWAL EHSAANIL KAREEME\nAnd noble kindness\nثُمَّ صَلِّ اثْنَيْ عَشَرَ رَكْعَةً فِي مَكَانِكَ\nSUMMA SALLIS NAY A’SHARA RAK-A’TAN FEE MAKAANEKA\nThen pray twelve units (rak‘ahs) in your place\nوَاقْرَاْ مَا شِئْتَ مِنَ السُّورِ وَاَهْدِهَا اِلَى الاِمَامِ الزَّمَانِ (عَجَّلَ اللّٰهُ فَرَجَهُ)\nWAQ RA-A MAA SHEATA MENAS SOORE WA AHDEHAA ELAL EMAAMIZ ZAMAANE (A’JJALAL LAAHO FARAJAHU)\nAnd recite whichever surahs you wish and dedicate them to Imam al-Zaman (may Allah hasten his reappearance)\nبَعْدَ كُلِّ رَكْعَتَيْنِ، اقْرَاْ تَسْبِيحَةَ جَنَابِ الزَّهْرَاء (س)\nBA’DA KULLE RAK-A’TAYN, IQRA-A TASBEEHATA JANAABIZ ZAHRAAA (S)\nAfter every two units, recite the Tasbih of Lady Zahra (peace be upon her)\nوَقُلْ:\nWA QUL\nAnd say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ السَّلَامُ وَمِنْكَ السَّلَامُ وَاِلَيْكَ يَعُودُ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTAS SALAAMO WA MINKAS SALAAMO WA ELAYKA YA-O’ODUS SALAAMO\nO Allah, You are Peace, and from You is peace, and to You returns peace\nحَيِّنَا رَبَّنَا مِنْكَ بِالسَّلَامِ\nHAYYENAA RABBANAA MINKA BIS-SALAAME\nGreet us, our Lord, with peace from You\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّ هَذِهِ الرَّكْعَاتِ هَدِيَّةٌ مِنِّي اِلَى وَلِيِّكَ وَابْنِ وَلِيِّكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNA HAAZEHIR RAK-A’ATE HADIYYATUM MINNEE ELAA WALIYYEKA WABNE WALIYYEKA\nO Allah, these units of prayer are a gift from me to Your guardian and the son of Your guardian\nوَابْنِ اَوْلِيَائِكَ، الاِمَامِ ابْنِ الَائِمَّةِ\nWABNE AWLEYAAA-EKAL EMAAMIBNIL A-IMMATE\nAnd the son of Your saints, the Imam, son of the Imams\nالْخَلَفِ الصَّالِحِ الْحُجَّةِ\nALKHALAFIS SAALEHIL HUJJATE\nThe righteous successor, the proof\nصَاحِبِ الزَّمَانِ\nSAAHEBIZ ZAMAANE\nThe Master of the Age\nفَصَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nFA-SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nSo send blessings upon Muhammad and the family of Muhammad\nوَبَلِّغْهُ اِيَّاهَا وَاَعْطِنِي اَفْضَلَ اَمَلِي وَرَجَائِي فِيكَ وَفِي رَسُولِكَ\nWA BALLIGH-HO IYYAAHAA WA A-A’TENEE AFZALA AMALEE WA RAJAAA-EE FEEKA WA FEE RASOOLEKA\nAnd convey it to him, and grant me the best of hopes and aspirations in You and Your Messenger\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلَىٰ آلِهٖ اَجْمَعِينَ\nSALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA A’LAA AALEHI AJMA-E’ENA\nYour blessings be upon him and all his family\nفَاِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْوَهَّابُ، وَاَنْتَ الْغَفُورُ، وَاَنْتَ الرَّحِيمُ\nFA-INNAKA ANTAL WAHHAABO WA ANTAL GHAFOORO WA ANTAR RAHEEMO\nIndeed, You are the Bestower, and You are the Forgiving, and You are the Merciful\nوَاَنْتَ الْعَلِيُّ الْكَبِيرُ، وَاَنْتَ الْمَلِكُ الْقُدُّوسُ\nWA ANTAL A’LIYYUL KABEERO WA ANTAL MALEKUL QUDDOOSO\nAnd You are the Most High, the Great, and You are the Sovereign, the Holy\nوَاَنْتَ الْمُقْسِطُ، وَاَنْتَ الْحَكِيمُ، وَاَنْتَ الْوَكِيلُ\nWA ANTAL MUQSETO WA ANTAL HAKEEMO WA ANTAL WAKEELO\nAnd You are the Just, and You are the Wise, and You are the Trustee\nوَاَنْتَ الْمُجِيبُ، وَاَنْتَ الْمُجِيرُ، وَاَنْتَ الْمُؤَيِّدُ\nWA ANTAL MOJEEBO WA ANTAL MOJEERO WA ANTAL MO-AYYEDO\nAnd You are the Responsive, and You are the Protector, and You are the Supporter\nوَاَنْتَ الْمُقَدِّمُ، وَاَنْتَ الْمُؤَخِّرُ، وَاَنْتَ الْعَزِيزُ الْجَبَّارُ\nWA ANTAL MOQADDEMO WA ANTAL MO-AKH-KHERO WA ANTAL A’ZEEZUL JABBAARO\nAnd You are the One Who advances and delays, and You are the Mighty, the Compeller\nوَاَنْتَ الْمُتَعَالِي، وَاَنْتَ الْحَكَمُ الْعَدْلُ\nWA ANTAL MOTA-A’ALEE WA ANTAL HAKAMUL A’DLO\nAnd You are the Most Exalted, and You are the Just Judge\nفَصَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ الطَّاهِرِينَ\nFA-SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA\nSo send blessings upon Muhammad and his pure family\nوَاجْعَلْنِي مِنْ اَنْصَارِهٖ وَاَعْوَانِهٖ\nWAJ A’LNEE MIN ANSAAREHI WA A-A’WAANEHI\nAnd make me among his supporters and helpers\nوَمِمَّنْ يَسْتَمِدُّ مِنْهُ الْقُوَّةَ وَالنَّصْرَ\nWA MIMMAN-Y YASTAMIDDO MINHUL QUWWATA WAN NASRA\nAnd among those who derive strength and victory from him\nوَالْحِمَايَةَ وَالْعِزَّةَ وَالْمَجْدَ\nWAL HEMAAYATA WAL I’ZZATA WAL MAJDA\nAnd protection, honor, and glory\nوَالْفَوْزَ وَالنَّجَاحَ فِي الدُّنْيَا وَالْآخِرَةِ\nWAL FAWZA WAN NAJAAHA FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\nAnd success and triumph in this world and the Hereafter\nوَاَنْ تُحِبَّنِي وَتُحِبَّنِي فِيْكَ\nWA AN TOHIBBANEE WA TOHIBBANEE FEEKA\nAnd that You love me and make me love You\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَنِي مِنْ الْمُقَرَّبِينَ اِلَيْكَ\nWA AN TAJ-A’LANEE MENAL MOQARRABEENA ELAYKA\nAnd that You make me among those brought near to You\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَنِي مِنْ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ وَالْفِرْدَوْسِ\nWA AN TAJ-A’LANEE MIN AHLIL JANNATE WAL FIRDAWSE\nAnd that You make me among the people of Paradise and the highest Garden\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَنِي مِنْ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ مَعَ اَهْلِ بَيْتِ نَبِيِّكَ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهٖ\nWA AN TAJ-A’LANEE MIN AHLIL JANNATE MA-A’ AHLE BAYTE NABIYYEKA MOHAMMADIN SALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nAnd that You make me among the people of Paradise with the family of Your Prophet Muhammad, peace be upon him and his family\nآمِينَ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nAAMEENA YAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nAmen, O Lord of the worlds\nآمِينَ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nAAMEENA YAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nAmen, O Lord of the Worlds\nوَصَلَّى اللهُ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهٖ اَجْمَعِينَ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHI AJMA-E’ENA\nAnd may Allah’s blessings be upon Muhammad and all his family\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ عِبَادِهِ الَّذِينَ اصْطَفَىٰ\nWAS SALAAMO A’LAA E’BAADEHIL LAZEENAS TAFAA\nAnd peace be upon His chosen servants\nمُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ الطَّاهِرِينَ\nMOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA\nMuhammad and his pure family\nThen kiss the grave and enter humbly crying for surely this is the permission from them, blessings of Allah be on them all.\nBehaar al-Anwaar, vol. 102, pg. 115\nZiyaarat of Imam-e-Zamaan (a.t.f.s.) in the Holy Cellar The First Ziyaarat Sayed Ali Ibn Taawoos (may Allah illuminate his grave) says, ‘When you finish with the ziyaarat of the tenth and the eleventh Imams (a.s.), go to the cellar, stand on its door and say:\nThen go down placing your right foot first and say:\nThen say\nAfter reaching in the cellar, face the Qiblah and say:\nThen raise your hands and pray:\nThereafter, pray twelve units of prayers in your place, read whichever surahs you like and gift it to Imam-e-Zamaan (a.t.f.s.). After every two units of prayers, recite the tasbih of Janab-e-Zahra (s.a.) and say:\nWhen you are through with the prayers, recite the supplication famous as ‘The supplication in occultation’, which commences with the following words: اللّٰهمّ عرِّفنِىْ نفسك فانّك ان لم تعرِّفني نفسك لم أعرف رسولك… which we have mentioned in the deeds of Friday and its eve.",
