    "Second Ziyarat at the Sardab\nZiyarah at Sirdaab\nThe following form of ziyarah is quoted from the highly esteemed reference books:\nYou may stop at the gate of the holy vault and say the following words:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَلِيفةَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHALEEFATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O vicegerent of Allah\nوَخَلِيفَةَ آبَائِهِ الْمَهْدِيِّينَ\nWA KHALEEFATA AABAAA-EHIL MAHDIYYEENA\nand vicegerent of your well-guided fathers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَصِيَّ الَاوْصِيَاءِ الْمَاضِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WASIYYAL AWSEYAAA-IL MAAZEENA\nPeace be upon you, O successor of the past successors (of the Prophets).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَافِظَ اَسْرَارِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HAAFEZA ASRAARE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA\nPeace be upon you, O keeper of the secrets of the Lord of the worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَقِيَّةَ اللّٰهِ مِنَ الصَّفْوَةِ الْمُنْتَجَبِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAQIYYATAL LAAHE MENAS SAFWATIL MUNTAJABEENA\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s remainder from among the elite, select ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ الَانْوَارِ الزَّاهِرَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL ANWAARIZ ZAAHERATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the luminous lights.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ الَاعْلَامِ الْبَاهِرَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL A-A’LAAMIL BAAHERATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the splendid signs.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ الْعِتْرَةِ الطَّاهِرَةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL I’TRATIT TAAHERATE\nPeace be upon you, O son of the immaculate progeny.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَعْدِنَ الْعُلُومِ النَّبَوِيَّةِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MA’DENAL O’LOOMIN NABAWIYYATE\nPeace be upon you, O essence of the Prophetic knowledge.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَابَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAABAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s gate;\nالَّذِي لََا يُؤْتَىٰ اِِلَّا مِنْهُ\nALLAZEE LAA YOATAA ILLAA MINHO\nthe only gate from which one can enter to Him.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَبِيلَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SABEELAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s course\nالَّذِي مَنْ سَلَكَ غَيْرَهٗ هَلَكَ\nALLAZEE MAN SALAKA GHAYRAHU HALAKA\nthat perdition will be the result of anyone who takes other than it.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَاظِرَ شَجَرَةِ طُوبَىٰ وَسِدْرَةِ الْمُنْتَهَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NAAZERA SHAJARATE TOOBAA WA SIDRATIL MUNTAHAA\nPeace be upon you, O observer of the Tree of Bliss (tuba) and the Farthest Lot-tree.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُورَ اللّٰهِ الَّذِي لََا يُطْفَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL LAAHIL LAZEE LAA YUTFAA\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s light that never extinguishes.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ الَّتِي لََا تَخْفَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHIL LATEE LAA TAKHFAA\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s decisive argument that is never hidden.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s decisive argument\nعَلَىٰ مَنْ فِي الَارْضِ وَالسَّمَاءِ\nA’LAA MAN FIL ARZE WAS SAMAAA-E\nagainst all those on the earth and in the heavens.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ سَلَامَ مَنْ عَرَفَكَ بِمَا عَرَّفَكَ بِهِ اللّٰهُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA SALAAMA MAN A’RAFAKA BEMAA A’RRAFAKA BEHIL LAAHO\nPeace be upon you; a salutation of one who recognizes you as exactly as Allah has introduced you\nوَنَعَتَكَ بِبَعْضِ نُعُوتِكَ\nWA NA-A’TAKA BE-BA’ZE NO-O’OTEKA\nand one who mentions only some of your characteristics\nالَّتِي اَنْتَ اَهْلُهَا وَفَوْقَهَا\nALLATEE ANTA AHLOHAA WA FAWQAHAA\nthat you are worthy of and even more.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْحُجَّةُ عَلَىٰ مَنْ مَضَىٰ وَمَنْ بَقِيَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKAL HUJJATO A’LAA MAM MAZAA WA MAN BAQEYA\nI bear witness that you are the argument against the past and the coming generations,\nوَاَنَّ حِزْبَكَ هُمُ الْغَالِبُونَ\nWA ANNA HIZBAKA HOMUL GHAALEBOONA\nyour party are the true triumphant,\nوَاَوْلِيَاءَكَ هُمُ الْفَائِزُونَ\nWA AWLEYAAA-AKA HOMUL FAAA-EZOONA\nyour friends are the true winners,\nوَاَعْدَاءَكَ هُمُ الْخَاسِرُونَ\nWA A-A’DAAA-AKA HOMUL KHAASEROONA\nyour enemies are truly losers,\nوَاَنَّكَ خَازِنُ كُلِّ عِلْمٍ\nWA ANNAKA KHAAZENO KULLE I’LMIN\nyou are the keeper of the entire knowledge,\nوَفَاتِقُ كُلِّ رَتْقٍ\nWA FAATEQO KULLE RATQIN\nyou are the opener of all closed things,\nوَمُحَقِّقُ كُلِّ حَقٍّ\nWA MOHAQQEQO KULLE HAQQIN\nyou are the establisher of all truths,\nوَمُبْطِلُ كُلِّ بَاطِلٍ\nWA MUBTELO KULLE BAATELIN\nand you are the eradicator of all wrong things.\nرَضِيتُكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ اِِمَاماً وَهَادِياً\nRAZEETOKA YAA MAWLAAYA EMAAMANW WA HAADEYAN\nO my master, I accept you as my leader, guide,\nوَوَلِيّاً وَمُرْشِداً\nWA WALIYYANW WA MURSHEDAN\nmaster, and adviser.\nلََا اَبْتَغي بِكَ بَدَلَاً\nLAA ABTAGHEE BEKA BADALAN\nI never seek any alternative\nوَلَا اَتَّخِذُ مِنْ دُونِكَ وَلِيّاً\nWA LAA ATTAKHEZO MIN DOONEKA WALIYYAN\nand I never betake myself any master save You.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْحَقُّ الثَّابِتُ\nASH-HADO ANNAKAL HAQQUS SAABETO\nI bear witness that you are verily the unchanging truth\nالَّذِي لََا عَيْبَ فِيهِ\nALLAZEE LAA A’YBA FEEHE\nthat is free of any defect\nوَاَنَّ وَعْدَ اللّٰهِ فِيكَ حَقٌّ\nWA ANNA WA’DAL LAAHE FEEKA HAQQUN\nand that Allah’s promise concerning you is so true\nلََا اَرْتَابُ لِطُولِ الغَيْبَةِ وَبُعْدِ الَامَدِ\nLAA ARTAABO LE-TOOLIL GHAYBATE WA BO’DIL AMADE\nthat I never doubt no matter how long the occultation will take and the time (of your advent) will be far\nوَلَا اَتَحَيَّرُ مَعَ مَنْ جَهِلَكَ وَجَهِلَ بِكَ\nWA LAA ATAHAYYARO MA-A’ MAN JAHELAKA WA JAHELA BEKA\nand I will never have misgivings like those who ignore you and ignore the truth that you represent\nمُنْتَظِرٌ مُتَوَقِّعٌ لَايَّامِكَ\nMUNTAZERUM MOTAWAQQE-U’L LE-AYYAAMEKA\nand I am waiting and expecting your age,\nوَاَنْتَ الشَّافِعُ الَّذِي لََا تُنَازَعُ\nWA ANTASH SHAAFE-U’L LAZEE LAA TONAAZA-O’\nfor you are the unmatched intercessor\nوَالْوَلِيُّ الَّذِي لََا تُدَافَعُ\nWAL WALIYYUL LAZEE LAA TODAAFA-O’\nand the irrefutable master.\nذَخَرَكَ اللّٰهُ لِنُصْرَةِ الدِّينِ\nZAKHARAKAL LAAHO LE-NUSRATID DEENE\nAllah has saved you for the support of the religion,\nوَاِِعْزَازِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWA E-E’ZAAZIL MOAMENEENA\nfor the fortification of the believers,\nوَالِانْتِقَامِ مِنَ الْجَاحِدِينَ الْمَارِقِينَ\nWAL INTEQAAME MENAL JAAHEDEENAL MAAREQEENA\nand for retaliating upon the deniers and the apostates.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ بِوِلَايَتِكَ تُقْبَلُ الَاعْمَالُ\nASH-HADO ANNA BE-WELAAYATEKA TUQBALUL A-A’MAALO\nI bear witness that through the loyalty to you, deeds are approved,\nوَتُزَكَّىٰ الَافْعَالُ\nWA TOZAKKAL AF-A’ALO\nacts are purified,\nوَتُضَاعَفُ الْحَسَنَاتُ\nWA TOZAA-A’FUL HASANAATO\nrewards are doubled,\nوَتُمْحَىٰ السَّيِّئَاتُ\nWA TUMHAS SAYYE-AATO\nand punishments for wrongdoings are erased.\nفَمَنْ جَاءَ بِوِلَايَتِكَ\nFAMAN JAAA-A BE-WELAAYATEKA\nTherefore, he who bears loyalty to you\nوَاعْتَرَفَ بِاِِمَامَتِكَ\nWA’TARAFA BE-EMAAMATEKA\nand recognizes your Imamate\nقُبِلَتْ اَعْمَالُهُ\nQOBELAT A-A’MAALOHU\nwill have his deeds approved,\nوَصُدِّقَتْ اَقْوَالُهُ\nWA SUDDEQAT AQWAALOHU\nhis sayings credited,\nوَتَضَاعَفَتْ حَسَنَاتُهٗ\nWA TAZAA-A’FAT HASANAATOHU\nhis rewards doubled,\nوَمُحِيَتْ سَيِّئَاتُهٗ\nWA MOHEYAT SAYYE-AATOHU\nand his wrongdoings erased;\nوَمَنْ عَدَلَ عَنْ وِلَايَتِكَ\nWA MAN A’DALA A’NW WELAAYATEKA\nwhile if he rejects loyalty to you,\nوَجَهِلَ مَعْرِفَتَكَ\nWA JAHELA MA’REFATAKA\nignores the recognition of you,\nوَاسْتَبْدَلَ بِكَ غَيْرَكَ\nWAS TABDALA BEKA GHAYRAKA\nand follows anyone else,\nكَبَّهُ اللّٰهُ عَلَىٰ مَنْخَرِهٖ فِي النَّارِ\nKABBAHUL LAAHO A’LAA MANKHAREHI FIN NAARE\nAllah shall throw him down in Hellfire on the nose,\nوَلَمْ يَقْبَلِ اللّٰهُ لَهٗ عَمَلَاً\nWA LAM YAQBALIL LAAHO LAHU A’MALAN\nshall never approve of any of his acts,\nوَلَمْ يُقِمْ لَهٗ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ وَزْناً\nWA LAM YOQIM LAHU YAWMAL QEYAAMATE WAZNAN\nand shall never set up a balance for him on the Day of Resurrection.\nاُشْهِدُ اللّٰهَ وَاُشْهِدُ مَلَائِكَتَهٗ\nUSH-HEDUL LAAHA WA USH-HEDO MALAAA-EKATAHU\nI ask Allah and His angels\nوَاُشْهِدُكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ بِهٰذَا\nWA USH-HEDOKA YAA MAWLAAYA BE-HAAZAA\nand you, my master, to testify to this for me;\nظَاهِرُهٗ كَبَاطِنِهٖ\nZAAHEROHU KABAATENEHI\nthe outward of this declaration is as same as its inward,\nوَسِرُّهٗ كَعَلَانِيَتِهٖ\nWA SIRROHU KA-A’LAANEYATEHI\nand its secret is as same as its overtness;\nوَاَنْتَ الشَّاهِدُ عَلَىٰ ذٰلِكَ\nWA ANTASH SHAAHEDO A’LAA ZAALEKA\nand you are the witness on this declaration,\nوَهُوَ عَهْدِي اِِلَيْكَ\nWA HOWA A’HDEE ELAYKA\nand this is my pledge with you\nوَمِيثَاقِي لَدَيْكَ\nWA MEESAAQEE LADAYKA\nand my covenant to you\nاِِذْ اَنْتَ نِظَامُ الدِّينِ\nIZ ANTA NEZAAMUD DEENE\nsince you are verily the system of the religion,\nوَيَعْسُوبُ الْمُتَّقِينَ\nWA YA’SOOBUL MUTTAQEENA\nthe leader of the pious ones,\nوَعِزُّ الْمُوَحِّدِينَ\nWA I’ZZUL MOWAHHEDEENA\nand the dignity of the monotheists.\nوَبِذٰلِكَ اَمَرَنِي رَبُّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nWA BE-ZAALEKA AMARANEE RABBUL A’ALAMEENA\nThis is the command of the Lord of the Worlds to me.\nفَلَوْ تَطَاوَلَتِ الدُّهُورُ\nFALAW TATAAWALATID DOHOORO\nEven if times take longer periods\nوَتَمَادَتِ الَاعْمَارُ\nWA TAMAADATIL A-A’MAARO\nand ages extend,\nلَمْ اَزْدَدْ فِيكَ اِِلَّا يَقِيناً\nLAM AZDAD FEEKA ILLAA YAQEENAN\nthis will increase in me nothing but more belief in you,\nوَلَكَ اِِلَّا حُبّاً\nWA LAKA ILLAA HUBBAN\nlove for you,\nوَعَلَيْكَ اِِلَّا مُتَّكَلَاً وَمُعْتَمَداً\nWA A’LAYKA ILLAA MUTTAKALANW WA MO’TAMADAN\nreliance on and trust in you,\nوَلِظُهُورِكَ اِِلَّا مُتَوَقِّعاً وَمُنْتَظِراً\nWA LE-ZOHOOREKA ILLAA MOTAWAQQE-A’NW WA MUNTAZERAN\nanticipation and expectation of your advent,\nوَلِجِهَادِي بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ مُتَرَقِّباً\nWA LE-JEHAADEE BAYNA YADAYKA MOTARAQQEBAN\nand waiting to strive hard in your presence.\nفَاَبْذُلُ نَفْسِي وَمَالِي\nFA-ABZOLO NAFSEE WA MAALEE\nSo, I sacrifice myself, my fortune,\nوَوَلَدِي وَاَهْلِي\nWA WALADEE WA AHLEE\nmy sons, my family members,\nوَجَمِيعَ مَا خَوَّلَنِي رَبِّي بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ\nWA JAMEE-A’ MAA KHAWWALANEE RABBEE BAYNA YADAYKA\nand all that which my Lord has granted me for your sake\nوَالتَّصَرُّفَ بَيْنَ اَمْرِكَ وَنَهْيِكَ\nWAT TASARROFA BAYNA AMREKA WA NAHYEKA\nand for obeying your orders and refraining from that which you order me not to do.\nمَوْلَايَ فَاِنْ اَدْرَكْتُ اَيَّامَكَ الزَّاهِرَةَ\nMAWLAAYA FA-IN ADRAKTO AYYAAMAKAZ ZAAHERATA\nO my master, If I catch your thriving days\nوَاَعْلَامَكَ الْبَاهِرَةَ\nWA A-A’LAAMAKAL BAAHERATA\nand see your splendid signs,\nفَهَا اَنَا ذَا عَبْدُكَ\nFAHAA ANAA ZAA A’BDOKA\nthen, here I, a servant of you,\nالْمُتَصَرِّفُ بَيْنَ اَمْرِكَ وَنَهْيِكَ\nALMOTASARREFO BAYNA AMREKA WA NAHYEKA\nam yielding to your orders and abstaining from that which you order me not to do.\nاَرْجُو بِهِ الشَّهَادَةَ بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ\nARJOO BEHISH SHAHAADATA BAYNA YADAYKA\nThrough all that, I hope for martyrdom in your presence\nوَالْفَوْزَ لَدَيْكَ\nWAL FAWZA LADAYKA\nand success in your view.\nمَوْلَايَ فَاِنْ اَدْرَكَنِيَ الْمَوْتُ قَبْلَ ظُهُورِكَ\nMAWLAAYA FA-IN ADRAKANEYAL MAWTO QABLA ZOHOOREKA\nO my master, but if death comes upon me before your advent,\nفَاِنِّي اَتَوَسَّلُ بِكَ\nFA-INNEE ATAWASSALO BEKA\nthen I beseech you\nوَبِآبَائِكَ الطَّاهِرِينَ اِِلَىٰ اللّٰهِ تَعَالَىٰ\nWA BE-AABAAA-EKAT TAAHEREENA ELAL LAAHE TA-A’ALAA\nand your immaculate fathers to mediate for me before Allah the All-exalted\nوَاَسْاَلُهُ اَنْ يُصَلِّيَ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA AS-ALOHU AN-Y YOSALLEYA A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nWhom I pray to send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَاَنْ يَجْعَلَ لِي كَرَّةً فِي ظُهُورِكَ\nWA AN-Y YAJ-A’LA LEE KARRATAN FEE ZOHOOREKA\nand to decide for me a return after your advent\nوَرَجْعَةً فِي اَيَّامِكَ\nWA RAJ-A’TAN FEE AYYAAMEKA\nand a second life during your days\nلَابْلُغَ مِنْ طَاعَتِكَ مُرَادِي\nLE-ABLOGHA MIN TAA-A’TEKA MORAADEE\nso that I will attain obedience to you, which is my desire,\nوَاَشْفِيَ مِنْ اَعْدَائِكَ فُؤَادِي\nWA ASHFEYA MIN A-A’DAAA-EKA FO-AADEE\nand to heal my heart from your enemies.\nمَوْلَايَ وَقَفْتُ فِي زِيَارَتِكَ\nMAWLAAYA WAQAFTO FEE ZEYAARATEKA\nO my master, while I am visiting you, I am standing\nمَوْقِفَ الْخَاطِئِينَ النَّادِمِينَ\nMAWQEFAL KHAATE-EENAN NAADEMEENA\nin the position of the repentant wrongdoers,\nالْخَائِفِينَ مِنْ عِقَابِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nALKHAAA-EFEENA MIN E’QAABE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA\nwho fear the chastisement of the Lord of the Worlds\nوَقَدِ اتَّكَلْتُ عَلَىٰ شَفَاعَتِكَ\nWA QADIT TAKALTO A’LAA SHAFAA-A’TEKA\nand I am, meanwhile, depending upon your intercession for me\nوَرَجَوْتُ بِمُوَالَاتِكَ وَشَفَاعَتِكَ\nWA RAJAWTO BE-MOWAALAATEKA WA SHAFAA-A’TEKA\nand I, through my loyalty to you and your intercession for me, wish for\nمَحْوَ ذُنُوبِي\nMAHWA ZONOOBEE\neradication of my sins,\nوَسَتْرَ عُيُوبِي\nWA SATRA O’YOOBEE\ncovering of my defects,\nوَمَغْفِرَةَ زَلَلِي\nWA MAGHFERATA ZALALEE\nand forgiveness of my slips.\nفَكُنْ لِوَلِيِّكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nFAKUL LE-WALIYYEKA YAA MAWLAAYA\nSo, O my master, (please) help me—your servant—\nعِنْدَ تَحْقِيقِ اَمَلِهٖ\nI’NDA TAHQEEQE AMALEHI\nto achieve my hope\nوَاسْاَلِ اللّٰهَ غُفْرَانَ زَلَلِهِ\nWAS ALIL LAAHA GHUFRAANA ZALALEHI\nand (please) ask Allah to forgive my slips.\nفَقَدْ تَعَلَّقَ بِحَبْلِكَ\nFAQAD TA-A’LLAQA BE-HABLEKA\nVerily, I am clinging to your rope,\nوَتَمَسَّكَ بِوِلَايَتِكَ\nWA TAMASSAKA BE-WELAAYATEKA\nholding on my loyalty to you,\nوَتَبَرَّاَ مِنْ اَعْدَائِكَ\nWA TABARRA-A MIN A-A’DAAA-EKA\nand declaring my disavowal of your enemies.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHI\nO Allah, (please) bless Muhammad and his Household\nوَاَنْجِزْ لِوَلِيِّكَ مَا وَعَدْتَهٗ\nWA ANJIZ LE-WALIYYEKA MAA WA-A’DTAHU\nand fulfill Your promise to Your Vicegerent.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَظْهِرْ كَلِمَتَهٗ\nALLAAHUMMA AZHIR KALEMATAHU\nO Allah, (please) make prevalent his word,\nوَاَعْلِ دَعْوَتَهٗ\nWA A-A’LE DA’WATAHU\nelevate his mission,\nوَانْصُرْهُ عَلَىٰ عَدُوِّهٖ وَعَدُوِّكَ\nWAN SURHO A’LAA A’DUWWEHI WA A’DUWWEKA\nand support him against Your and his enemies,\nيَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nYAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nO Lord of the Worlds!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَاَظْهِرْ كَلِمَتَكَ التَّامَّةَ\nWA AZHIR KALEMATAKAT TAAMMATA\nand allow Your Perfect Word,\nوَمُغَيَّبَكَ فِي اَرْضِكَ\nWA MOGHAYYABAKA FEE ARZEKA\nYour concealed one in Your lands,\nالْخَائِفَ الْمُتَرَقِّبَ\nALKHAAA-EFAL MOTARAQQEBA\nthe afraid, and the vigilant, to reappear.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ انْصُرْهُ نَصْراً عَزِيزاً\nALLAAHUMMAN SURHO NASRAN A’ZEEZAN\nO Allah, (please) support him with powerful support\nوَافْتَحْ لَهٗ فَتْحاً يَسِيراً\nWAF TAH LAHU FAT-HAN-Y YASEERAN\nand give him a nigh victory.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاَعِزَّ بِهِ الدِّينَ بَعْدَ الْخُمُولِ\nALLAAHUMMA WA A-I’ZZA BEHID DEENA BA’DAL KHOMOOLE\nO Allah, (please) fortify the religion through him after it has been sluggish,\nوَاَطْلِعْ بِهِ الْحَقَّ بَعْدَ الاُفُولِ\nWA ATLE’ BEHIL HAQQA BA’DAL OFOOLE\ndemonstrate the truth through him after it has declined,\nوَاَجْلِ بِهِ الظُّلْمَةَ\nWA AJLE BEHIZ ZULMATA\nremove darkness through him,\nوَاكْشِفْ بِهِ الْغُمَّةَ\nWAK SHIF BEHIL GHUMMATA\nand relieve the grief through him.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَآمِنْ بِهِ الْبِلَادَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA AAMIN BEHIL BELAADA\nO Allah, (please) spread security over the lands through him\nوَاهْدِ بِهِ الْعِبَادَ\nWAH DE BEHIL E’BAADA\nand guide the servants (of You) through him.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ امْلَاْ بِهِ الَارْضَ عَدْلَاً وَقِسْطاً\nALLAAHUMMAM LA-A BEHIL ARZA A’DLANW WA QISTAN\nO Allah, (please) fill the earth with justice and equality through him\nكَمَا مُلِئَتْ ظُلْماً وَجَوْراً\nKAMAA MOLE-AT ZULMANW WA JAWRAN\nas it is filled with injustice and wrong.\nاِِنَّكَ سَمِيعٌ مُجِيبٌ\nINNAKA SAMEE-U’M MOJEEBUN\nVerily, You are All-hearing and Responding.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s vicegerent.\nاِئْذَنْ لِوَلِيِّكَ فِي الدُّخُولِ اِلَىٰ حَرَمِكَ\nEEZAL LE-WALIYYEKA FID DOKHOOLE ELAA HARAMEKA\n(please) permit me, your servant, to enter your sanctuary.\nصَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَيْكَ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYKA\nMay Allah’s blessings be upon you\nوَعَلَىٰ آبَائِكَ الطَّاهِرِينَ\nWA A’LAA AABAAA-EKAT TAAHEREENA\nand upon your immaculate fathers.\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAllah’s mercy and benedictions be upon you.\nYou may then come to the Occultation Vault and stop between the two doors, holding the door’s side with your hand. You may then hem and haw, as if you are seeking permission of entrance, and say these words:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحيمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME\nIn the Name of Allah; the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nYou may now come down with tranquility and present-heartedness. Offer a two-unit prayer in the yard of the vault and say the following words:\nاللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ اللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ اللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ\nALLAAHO AKBARUL LAAHO AKBARUL LAAHO AKBARO\nAllah is the Most Great. Allah is the Most Great. Allah is the Most Great.\nلََا اِِلٰهَ اِِلَّا اللّٰهُ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO\nThere is no god save Allah.\nوَاللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ وَلِلَّهِ الْحَمْدُ\nWAL LAAHO AKBARO WA LILLAAHIL HAMDO\nAllah is the Most Great and to Allah be all praise.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي هَدَانَا لِهٰذَا\nALHAMDO LILLAAHIL LAZEE HADAANAA LE-HAAZAA\nAll praise be to Allah Who has guided us to this,\nوَعَرَّفَنَا اَوْلِيَاءَهٗ وَاَعْدَاءَهٗ\nWA A’RRAFANAA AWLEYAAA-AHU WA A-A’DAAA-AHU\nmade us discriminate between His friends and enemies,\nوَوَفَّقَنَا لِزِيَارَةِ اَئِمَّتِنَا\nWA WAFFAQANAA LE-ZEYAARATE A-IMMATENAA\ngranted us success to visit our Imams,\nوَلَمْ يَجْعَلْنَا مِنَ الْمُعَانِدِينَ النَّاصِبِينَ\nWA LAM YAJ-A’LNAA MENAL MO-A’ANEDEENAN NAASEBEENA\nand has not made us of the obdurate antagonists (of the truth),\nوَلَا مِنَ الْغُلَاةِ الْمُفَوِّضِينَ\nWA LAA MENAL GHOLAATIL MOFAWWEZEENA\nnor of the immoderate indeterminists,\nوَلَا مِنَ الْمُرْتَابِينَ الْمُقَصِّرِينَ\nWA LAA MENAL MURTAABEENAL MOQASSEREENA\nnor of the suspicious and negligent.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ وَلِيِّ اللّٰهِ وَابْنِ اَوْلِيَائِهٖ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA WALIYYIL LAAHE WABNE AWLEYAAA-EHI\nPeace be upon Allah’s vicegerent and son of His vicegerents.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ الْمُدَّخَرِ لِكَرَامَةِ اَوْلِيَاءِ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL MUDDAKHARE LE-KARAAMATE AWLEYAAA-IL LAAHE\nPeace be upon the one saved for achieving dignity of Allah’s intimate servants\nوَبَوَارِ اَعْدَاءِهٖ\nWA BAWAARE A-A’DAAA-EHI\nand for ruining Allah’s enemies.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ النُّورِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAN NOORE\nPeace be upon the light\nالَّذِي اَرَادَ اَهْلُ الْكُفْرِ اِِطْفَاءَهٗ\nALLAZEE ARAADA AHLUL KUFRE ITFAAA-AHU\nthat the people of atheism intend to extinguish;\nفَاَبَىٰ اللّٰهُ اِِلَّا اَنْ يُتِمَّ نُورَهٗ بِكُرْهِهِمْ\nFA-ABAL LAAHO ILLAA AN-Y YOTIMMA NOORAHU BE-KURHEHIM\nbut Allah would not allow but that His light should be perfected, despite their contempt.\nوَاَيَّدَهٗ بِالْحَيَاةِ\nWA AYYADAHU BIL-HAYAATE\nHe thus supported him with survival\nحَتَّىٰ يُظْهِرَ عَلَىٰ يَدِهِ الْحَقَّ بِرَغْمِهِمْ\nHATTAA YUZHERA A’LAA YADEHIL HAQQA BE-RAGHMEHIM\nso that He shall make prevalent the truth at his hands against their will.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ اللّٰهَ اصْطَفَاكَ صَغِيراً\nASH-HADO ANNAL LAAHAS TAFAAKA SAGHEERAN\nI bear witness that Allah has chosen you since you were little\nوَاَكْمَلَ لَكَ عُلُومَهٗ كَبِيراً\nWA AKMALA LAKA O’LOOMAHU KABEERAN\nand perfected His knowledge for you when you grew up;\nوَاَنَّكَ حَيٌّ لََا تَمُوتُ\nWA ANNAKA HAYYUL LAA TAMOOTO\nand that you are alive and you will not die\nحَتَّىٰ تُبْطِلَ الْجِبْتَ وَالطَّاغُوتَ\nHATTAA TUBTELAL JIBTA WAT TAAGHOOTA\nbefore you efface all idols and false deities.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAYHE\nO Allah, (please) bless him\nوَعَلَىٰ خُدَّامِهٖ وَاَعْوَانِهٖ عَلَىٰ غَيْبَتِهٖ وَنَاْيِهٖ\nWA A’LAA KHUDDAAMEHI WA A-A’WAANEHI A’LAA GHAYBATEHI WA NAAYEHI\nand his servants and those who helped him to occult and hide from sights,\nوَاسْتُرْهُ سَتْراً عَزِيزاً\nWAS TURHO SATRAN A’ZEEZAN\ncover him with invulnerable covering,\nوَاجْعَلْ لَهٗ مَعْقِلَاً حَرِيزاً\nWAJ A’L LAHU MA’QELAN HAREEZAN\narrange for him an invincible haven,\nوَاشْدُدِ اللّٰهُمَّ وَطْاَتَكَ عَلَىٰ مُعَانِدِيهِ\nWASH DODIL LAAHUMMA WAT-ATAKA A’LAA MO-A’ANEDEEHE\nincrease, O Allah, Your intensity on those who resist him obdurately,\nوَاحْرُسْ مَوَالِيَهٗ وَزَائِرِيهِ\nWAH RUS MAWAALEYAHU WA ZAAA-EREEHE\nand guard his loyalists and visitors.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ كَمَا جَعَلْتَ قَلْبِي بِذِكْرِهٖ مَعْمُوراً\nALLAAHUMMA KAMAA JA-A’LTA QALBEE BE-ZIKREHI MA’MOORAN\nO Allah, just as You have made my heart full of reference to him,\nفَاجْعَلْ سِلَاحِي بِنُصْرَتِهٖ مَشْهُوراً\nFAJ-A’L SELAAHEE BE-NUSRATEHI MASH-HOORAN\nso also (please) make my weapon prepared in support of him.\nوَاِِنْ حَالَ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَ لِقَائِهِ\nWA IN HAALA BAYNEE WA BAYNA LEQAAA-EHI\nIf there comes between me and meeting him\nالْمَوْتُ الَّذِي جَعَلْتَهٗ عَلَىٰ عِبَادِكَ حَتْماً\nALMAWTUL LAZEE JA-A’LTAHU A’LAA E’BAADEKA HATMAN\ndeath, which You have made inescapable for Your servants\nوَاَقْدَرْتَ بِهٖ عَلَىٰ خَلِيقَتِكَ رَغْماً\nWA AQDARTA BEHI A’LAA KHALEEQATEKA RAGHMAN\nand have imposed upon Your creatures whether they will or not,\nفَابْعَثْنِي عِنْدَ خُرُوجِهٖ\nFAB-A’SNEE I’NDA KHOROOJEHI\nthen (please) restore me to life at his advent,\nظَاهِراً مِنْ حُفْرَتِي\nZAAHERAM MIN HUFRATEE\ncoming out from my hole (i.e. grave),\nمُؤْتَزِراً كَفَنِي\nMOATAZERAN KAFANEE\nand using my shroud as my garment\nحَتَّىٰ اُجَاهِدَ بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ\nHATTAA OJAAHEDA BAYNA YADAYHE\nso that I will fight strivingly in his presence\nفِي الصَّفِّ الَّذِي اَثْنَيْتَ عَلَىٰ اَهْلِهٖ\nFIS SAFFIL LAZEE ASNAYTA A’LAA AHLEHI\nin the line whose people have been praised by You\nفِي كِتَابِكَ فَقُلْتَ:\nFEE KETAABEKA FAQULTA\nin Your Book where You say,\n«كَاَنَّهُمْ بُنْيَانٌ مَرْصُوصٌ»\nKA-ANNAHUM BUNYAANUM MARSOOSUN\n“…as if they were a firm and compact wall.”\nاَللّٰهُمَّ طَالَ الِانْتِظَارُ\nALLAAHUMMA TAALAL INTEZAARO\nO Allah, too long has been the expectation,\nوَشَمِتَ مِنَا الْفُجَّارُ\nWA SHAMETA MINNAL FUJJAARO\nthe wicked are gloating at our misfortune,\nوَصَعُبَ عَلَيْنَا الِانْتِصَارُ\nWA SA-O’BA A’LAYNAL INTESAARO\nand victory has been difficult for us.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَرِنَا وَجْهَ وَلِيِّكَ الْمَيْمُونَ\nALLAAHUMMA ARENAA WAJHA WALIYYEKAL MAYMOONA\nO Allah, (please) show us the blessed face of Your vicegerent\nفِي حَيَاتِنَا وَبَعْدَ الْمَنُونِ\nFEE HAYAATENAA WA BA’DAL MANOONE\nin our lifetimes and after death.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِِنِّي اَدِينُ لَكَ بِالرَّجْعَةِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ADEENO LAKA BIR-RAJ-A’TE\nO Allah, I profess of the Return as my faith\nبَيْنَ يَدَيْ صَاحِبِ هٰذِهِ الْبُقْعَةِ\nBAYNA YADAY SAAHEBE HAAZEHIL BUQ-A’TE\nin the presence of the owner of this area.\nالْغَوْثَ الْغَوْثَ الْغَوْثَ\nALGHAWSAL GHAWSAL GHAWSA\n[I beseech for] Relief, relief, relief.\nيَا صَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ\nYAA SAAHEBAZ ZAMAANE\nO Patron of the Age!\nقَطَعْتُ فِي وُصْلَتِكَ الْخُلَّانَ\nQATA’TO FEE WUSLATEKAL KHULLAANA\nI have ruptured my relations with many friends in order to build good relations with you,\nوَهَجَرْتُ لِزِيَارَتِكَ الَاوْطَانَ\nWA HAJARTO LE-ZEYAARATEKAL AWTAANA\nI have deserted my homeland in order to visit you,\nوَاَخْفَيْتُ اَمْرِي عَنْ اَهْلِ الْبُلْدَانِ\nWA AKHFAYTO AMREE A’N AHLIL BULDAANE\nand I have concealed my intention from the peoples of the towns\nلِتَكُونَ شَفِيعاً عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ وَرَبِّي\nLE-TAKOONA SHAFEE-A’N I’NDA RABBEKA WA RABBEE\nso that you may be my intercessor with your and my Lord\nاِلَىٰ آبَائِكَ وَمَوَالِيَّ\nELAA AABAAA-EKA WA MAWAALIYYA\nand with your fathers and my masters,\nفِي حُسْنِ التَّوْفِيقِ لِي\nFEE HUSNIT TAWFEEQE LEE\nseeking excellence of success,\nوِاِِسْبَاغِ النِّعْمَةِ عَلَيَّ\nWA ISBAAGHIN NE’MATE A’LAYYA\nconferral of bounties,\nوَسَوْقِ الاِحْسَانِ اِِلَيَّ\nWA SAWQIL EHSAANE ELAYYA\nand making charitable acts run towards me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nاَصْحَابِ الْحَقِّ\nAS-HAABIL HAQQE\nthe rightful ones\nوَقَادَةِ الْخَلْقِ\nWA QAADATIL KHALQE\nand the leaders of the creatures,\nوَاسْتَجِبْ مِنِّي مَا دَعَوْتُكَ\nWAS TAJIB MINNEE MAA DA-A’WTOKA\nand (please) respond to me in what I have besought You for\nوَاَعْطِنِي مَا لَمْ اَنْطِقْ بِهٖ فِي دُعَائِي\nWA A-A’TENEE MAA LAM ANTIQ BEHI FEE DO-A’A-EE\nand grant me all that which I have not mentioned in my prayer,\nمِنْ صَلَاحِ دِينِي وَدُنْيَايَ\nMIN SALAAHE DEENEE WA DUNYAAYA\nsuch as the uprightness of my faith and my worldly affairs.\nاِِنَّكَ حَمِيدٌ مَجِيدٌ\nINNAKA HAMEEDUM MAJEEDUN\nYou are verily worthy of praise and worthy of glory.\nوَصَلِّىٰ اللّٰهُ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ الطَّاهِرِينَ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA\nMay Allah bless Muhammad and his Immaculate Household.\nYou may then enter the hall, offer a two-unit prayer, and say the following words:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ عَبْدُكَ الزَّائِرُ\nALLAAHUMMA A’BDOKAZ ZAAA-ERO\nO Allah, I—Your visiting servant—\nفِي فِنَاءِ وَلِيِّكَ الْمَزُورِ\nFEE FENAAA-E WALIYYEKAL MAZOORE\nam in the yard of Your visited vicegerent\nالَّذِي فَرَضْتَ طَاعَتَهٗ عَلَىٰ الْعَبِيدِ وَالَاحْرَارِ\nALLAZEE FARAZTA TAA-A’TAHU A’LAL A’BEEDE WAL AHRAARE\nthe obedience to whom has been made obligatory by You on the slaves and the free\nوَاَنْقَذْتَ بِهٖ اَوْلِيَاءَكَ مِنْ عَذَابِ النَّارِ\nWA ANQAZTA BEHI AWLEYAAA-AKA MIN A’ZAABIN NAARE\nand through whom You shall save Your intimate servants from the chastisement of Hellfire.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْهَا زِيَارَةً مَقْبُولَةً\nALLAAHUMMAJ A’LHAA ZEYAARATAM MAQBOOLATAN\nO Allah, (please) decide it to be an admitted visitation\nذَاتَ دُعَاءٍ مُسْتَجَابٍ\nZAATA DO-A’A-IM MUSTAJAABIN\nof a granted prayer\nمِنْ مُصَدِّقٍ بِوَلِيِّكَ غَيْرِ مُرْتَابٍ\nMIM MOSADDEQIN BE-WALIYYEKA GHAYRE MURTAABIN\nfrom one who gives full credence to Your vicegerent and who never suspects him.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لََا تَجْعَلْهُ آخِرَ الْعَهْدِ بِهٖ وَلَا بِزِيَارَتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ-A’LHO AAKHERAL A’HDE BEHI WA LAA BE-ZEYAARATEHI\nO Allah, (please) do not decide this to be the last of my presence and visitation to him\nوَلَا تَقْطَعْ اَثَرِي مِنْ مَشْهَدِهٖ\nWA LAA TAQTA’ ASAREE MIM MASH-HADEHI\nand do not cut off my traces in his shrine\nوَزِيَارَةِ اَبِيهِ وَجَدِّهٖ\nWA ZEYAARATE ABEEHE WA JADDEHI\nand in visitation to his father and grandfather.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَخْلِفْ عَلَيَّ نَفَقَتِي\nALLAAHUMMA AKHLIF A’LAYYA NAFAQATEE\nO Allah, (please) compensate for me my expenditure,\nوَانْفَعْنِي بِمَا رَزَقْتَنِي\nWAN FA’NEE BEMAA RAZAQTANEE\nmake me benefit from the sustenance that You have provided me\nفِي دُنْيَايَ وَآخِرَتِي\nFEE DUNYAAYA WA AAKHERATEE\nin my worldly life and in my Next Life,\nلِي وَلاِِِخْوَانِي وَاَبَوَيَّ\nLEE WA LE-IKHWAANEE WA ABAWAYYA\nand do the same to my brothers, parents,\nوَجَمِيعِ عِتْرَتِي\nWA JAMEE-E’ I’TRATEE\nand all of my offspring.\nاَسْتَودِعُكَ اللّٰهَ اَيُّهَا الاِمَامُ\nASTAWDE-O’KAL LAAHA AYYOHAL EMAAMO\nI entrust you with Allah, O Leader\nالَّذِي يَفُوزُ بِهِ الْمُؤْمِنُونَ\nALLAZEE YAFOOZO BEHIL MOAMENOONA\nthrough whom the believers will win\nوَيَهْلِكُ عَلَىٰ يَدَيْهِ الْكَافِرُونَ الْمُكَذِّبُونَ\nWA YAHLEKO A’LAA YADAYHIL KAAFEROONAL MOKAZZEBOONA\nand at whose hands the belying unbelievers will perish.\nيَا مَوْلَايَ يَا بْنَ الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nYAA MAWLAAYA YABNAL HASANIBNE A’LIYYIN\nO my master! O son of al-Hasan the son of `Ali,\nجِئْتُكَ زَائِراً لَكَ وَلَابِيكَ وَجَدِّكَ\nJEATOKA ZAAA-ERAL LAKA WA LE-ABEEKA WA JADDEKA\nI have come to you visiting you, your father, and your grandfather,\nمُتَيَقِّناً الْفَوْزَ بِكُمْ\nMOTAYAQQENANIL FAWZA BEKUM\nbeing certain of winning through you,\nمُعْتَقِداً اِِمَامَتَكُمْ\nMO’TAQEDAN EMAAMATAKUM\nand having full faith in your Imamate.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اكْتُبْ هٰذِهِ الشَّهَادَةَ وَالزِّيَارَةَ لِي\nALLAAHUMMAK TUB HAAZEHISH SHAHAADATA WAZ ZEYAARATA LEE\nO Allah, (please) write down this testimony and visitation to me\nعِنْدَكَ فِي عِلِّيِّينَ\nI’NDAKA FEE I’LLIYYEENA\nwith You in the Most Elevated Place,\nوَبَلِّغْنِي بَلَاغَ الصَّالِحِينَ\nWA BALLIGHNEE BALAAGHAS SAALEHEENA\nmake me attain that which is attained by the righteous ones,\nوَانْفَعْنِي بِحُبِّهِمْ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nWAN FA’NEE BE-HUBBEHIM YAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nand make me benefit by my love for them, O Lord of the Worlds.",
    "Ziyarat by Sayyid Ibn Tawus\nAnother Form of Ziyarah reported by Sayyid Ibn Tawus:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ الْحَقِّ الْجَدِيدِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL HAQQIL JADEEDE\nPeace be upon the fresh truth\nوَالْعَالِمِ الَّذِي عِلْمُهٗ لََا يَبِيدُ\nWAL A’ALEMIL LAZEE I’LMOHU LAA YABEEDO\nand the knowledgeable whose knowledge never expires.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ مُحْيِي الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA MOHYIL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon the reviver of the believers\nوَمُبِيرِ الْكَافِرِينَ\nWA MOBEERIL KAAFEREENA\nand the terminator of the unbelievers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ مَهْدِيِّ الاُمَمِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA MAHDIYYIL OMAME\nPeace be upon the restorer of all nations\nوَجَامِعِ الْكَلِمِ\nWA JAAME-I’L KALEME\nand the combiner of all creeds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ خَلَفِ السَّلَفِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA KHALAFIS SALAFE\nPeace be upon the successor of the ancestors\nوَصَاحِبِ الشَّرَفِ\nWA SAAHEBISH SHARAFE\nand the owner of honor.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ حُجَّةِ الْمَعْبُودِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA HUJJATIL MA’BOODE\nPeace be upon the argument of the Worshipped (Lord)\nوَكَلِمَةِ الْمَحْمُودِ\nWA KALEMATIL MAHMOODE\nand the Word of the Praised (Lord).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ مُعِزِّ الَاوْلِيَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA MO-I’ZZIL AWLEYAAA-E\nPeace be upon the consolidator of the intimate servants (of God)\nوَمُذِلِّ الَاعْدَاءِ\nWA MOZILLIL A-A’DAAA-E\nand the humiliator of the enemies.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ وَارِثِ الَانْبِيَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA WAARESIL ANBEYAAA-E\nPeace be upon the inheritor of the Prophets\nوَخَاتِمِ الَاوْصِيَاءِ\nWA KHAATEMIL AWSEYAAA-E\nand the seal of the (Prophets’) successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ الْقَائِمِ الْمُنْتَظَرِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL QAAA-EMIL MUNTAZARE\nPeace be upon the Rising (Imam), the awaited,\nوَالْعَدْلِ الْمُشْتَهَرِ\nWAL A’DLIL MUSHTAHARE\nand the famed establisher of justice.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ السَّيْفِ الشَّاهِرِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAS SAYFISH SHAAHERE\nPeace be upon the unsheathed sword,\nوَالْقَمَرِ الزَّاهِرِ\nWAL QAMARIZ ZAAHERE\nthe brilliant moon,\nوَالنُّوُرِ الْبَاهِرِ\nWAN NOORIL BAAHERE\nand the dazzling light.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ شَمْسِ الظَّلَامِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA SHAMSIZ ZALAAME\nPeace be upon the sun of darkness\nوَبَدْرِ التَّمَامِ\nWA BADRIT TAMAAME\nand the absolutely full moon.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ رَبِيعِ الَانَامِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA RABEE-I’L ANAAME\nPeace be upon the springtime of humanity\nوَنَضْرَةِ الَايَّامِ\nWA NAZRATIL AYYAAME\nand the bloom of days.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ صَاحِبِ الصَّمْصَامِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA SAAHEBIS SAMSAAME\nPeace be upon the holder of sharp sword\nوَفَلَّاقِ الْهَامِ\nWA FALLAAQIL HAAME\nand the splitter of heads.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ الدِّينِ الْمَاْثُورِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAD DEENIL MAASOORE\nPeace be upon the long-established faith\nوَالْكِتَابِ الْمَسْطُورِ\nWAL KETAABIL MASTOORE\nand the scripture inscribed.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ بَقِيَّةِ اللّٰهِ فِي بِلَادِهٖ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA BAQIYYATIL LAAHE FEE BELAADEHI\nPeace be upon the Remnant of Allah (Baqiyyatullah) in His lands\nوَحُجَّتِهٖ عَلَىٰ عِبَادِهِ\nWA HUJJATEHI A’LAA E’BAADEHI\nand the argument of Him against His servants\nالْمُنْتَهِي اِِلَيْهِ مَوَارِيثُ الَانْبِيَاءِ\nALMUNTAHEE ELAYHE MAWAAREESUL ANBEYAAA-E\nto whom the inheritances of the Prophets end\nوَلَدَيْهِ مَوْجوُدٌ آثَارُ الَاصْفِيَاءِ\nWA LADAYHE MAWJOODUN AASAARUL ASFEYAAA-E\nand with whom the traditions of the elite ones are kept.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ الْمُؤْتَمَنِ عَلَىٰ السِّرِّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL MOATAMANE A’LAS SIRRE\nPeace be upon the one entrusted with the secret\nوَالْوَلِيِّ لِلَامْرِ\nWAL WALIYYE LIL-AMRE\nand the one who shall undertake the mission.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَىٰ الْمَهْدِيِّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL MAHDIYYE\nPeace be upon al-Mahdi (the rightly guided)\nالَّذِي وَعَدَ اللّٰهُ عَزَّ وَجَلَّ بِهِ الاُمَمَ\nALLAZEE WA-A’DAL LAAHO A’ZZA WA JALLA BEHIL OMAMA\nthrough whom Allah the Almighty and All-majestic promised the nations\nاَنْ يَجْمَعَ بِهِ الْكَلِمَ\nAN-Y YAJMA-A’ BEHIL KALEMA\nto combine all decrees,\nوَيَلُمَّ بِهِ الشَّعَثَ\nWA YALUMMA BEHISH SHA-A’SA\nto bring together all scattered matters,\nوَيَمْلَاَ بِهِ الَارْضَ قِسْطاً وَعَدْلَاً\nWA YAMLA-A BEHIL ARZA QISTANW WA A’DLAN\nto fill the earth with fairness and justice,\nوَيُمَكِّنَ لَهٗ\nWA YOMAKKENA LAHU\nto make possible for him (to win over the all),\nوَيُنْجِزَ بِهٖ وَعْدَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWA YUNJEZA BEHI WA’DAL MOAMENEENA\nand to fulfill His promise to the believers.\nاَشْهَدُ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nASH-HADO YAA MAWLAAYA\nI bear witness, O my master,\nاَنَّكَ وَالَائِمَّةَ مِنْ آبَائِكَ\nANNAKA WAL A-IMMATA MIN AABAAA-EKA\nthat you and the Imams, your fathers,\nاَئِمَّتِي وَمَوَالِيَّ\nA-IMMATEE WA MAWAALIYYA\nare my leaders and masters\nفِي الْحَيَاةِ الدُّنْيَا وَيَوْمَ يَقُومُ الَاشْهَادُ\nFIL HAYAATID DUNYAA WA YAWMA YAQOOMUL ASH-HAADO\nin this worldly life and on the day when the Witnesses will rise (to witness).\nاَسْاَلُكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nAS-ALOKA YAA MAWLAAYA\nI thus ask you, O my master,\nاَنْ تَسْاَلَ اللّٰهَ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالَىٰ\nAN TAS-ALAL LAAHA TABAARAKA WA TA-A’ALAA\nto ask Allah the All-blessed and All-exalted\nفِي صَلَاحِ شَاْنِي\nFEE SALAAHE SHAANEE\nto set aright all my affairs,\nوَقَضَاءِ حَوَائِجِي\nWA QAZAAA-E HAWAAA-EJEE\nto grant me all my needs,\nوَغُفْرَانِ ذُنُوبِي\nWA GHUFRAANE ZONOOBEE\nto forgive my sins,\nوَالَاخْذِ بِيَدِي\nWAL AKHZE BE-YADEE\nand to lead me rightly\nفِي دِينِي وَدُنْيَايَ وَآخِرَتِي\nFEE DEENEE WA DUNYAAYA WA AAKHERATEE\nin the affairs of my faith, worldly life, and the Next Life,\nلِي وَلاِِِخْوَانِي وَاَخَوَاتِي الْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ كَافَّةً\nLEE WA LE-IKHWAANEE WA AKHAWAATIL MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE KAAFFATAN\nas well as the affairs of my all believing brothers and sisters.\nاِِنَّهٗ غَفوُرٌ رَحِيمٌ\nINNAHU GHAFOORUR RAHEEMUN\nVerily, He is All-forgiving, All-merciful.\nYou may then offer the twelve-unit prayer of ziyarah, separating between each two units with a Taslim statement (i.e. the last part of prayers). You may then utter the (famous) Tasbih al-Zahra' litany and provide all that as present to the Imam. Upon accomplishment, you may say the following prayer:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ حُجَّتِكَ فِي اَرْضِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA HUJJATEKA FEE ARZEKA\nO Allah, (please) bless Your Argument in Your land,\nوَخَلِيفَتِكَ فِي بِلَادِكَ\nWA KHALEEFATEKA FEE BELAADEKA\nYour representative in Your countries,\nالدَّاعِي اِلَىٰ سَبِيلِكَ\nADDAA-E’E ELAA SABEELEKA\nthe caller to Your way,\nوَالْقَائِمِ بِقِسْطِكَ\nWAL QAAA-EME BE-QISTEKA\nthe establisher of Your justice,\nوَالْفَائِزِ بِاَمْرِكَ\nWAL FAAA-EZE BE-AMREKA\nthe winner of Your decree,\nوَلِيِّ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWALIYYIL MOAMENEENA\nthe guardian of the believers,\nوَمُبِيرِ الْكَافِرِينَ\nWA MOBEERIL KAAFEREENA\nthe terminator of the unbelievers,\nوَمُجَلِّي الظُّلْمَةِ\nWA MOJALLIZ ZULMATE\nthe eliminator of darkness,\nوَمُنِيرِ الْحَقِّ\nWA MONEERIL HAQQE\nthe illuminator of the truth,\nوَالصَّادِعِ بِالْحِكْمةِ\nWAS SAADE-E’ BIL-HIKMATE\nthe expounder with wisdom,\nوَالْمَوْعِظَةِ الْحَسَنَةِ وَالصِّدْقِ\nWAL MAW-E’ZATIL HASANATE WAS SIDQE\nexcellent exhortation, and veracity,\nوَكَلمَتِكَ وَعَيْبَتِكَ\nWA KALEMATEKA WA A’YBATEKA\nYour Word, the carrier of Your secrets,\nوَعَيْنِكَ فِي اَرْضِكَ\nWA A’YNEKA FEE ARZEKA\nYour Eye in Your lands,\nالْمُتَرَقِّبِ الْخَائِفِ\nALMOTARAQQEBIL KHAAA-EFE\nthe vigilant, the afraid,\nالْوَلِيِّ النَّاصِحِ\nALWALIYYIN NAASEHE\nthe sincere vicegerent,\nسَفِينَةِ النَّجَاةِ\nSAFEENATIN NAJAATE\nthe ark of salvation,\nوَعَلَمِ الْهُدَىٰ\nWA A’LAMIL HODAA\nthe pennon of right guidance,\nوَنُورِ اَبْصَارِ الْوَرَىٰ\nWA NOORE ABSAARIL WARAA\nthe light of the eyes of all creatures,\nوَخَيْرِ مَنْ تَقَمَّصَ وَارْتَدَىٰ\nWA KHAYRE MAN TAQAMMASA WAR TADAA\nthe best of all those who dress shirts and garments,\nوَالْوِتْرِ الْمَوْتُورِ\nWAL WITRIL MAWTOORE\nthe unique whose folks have not been avenged yet,\nوَمُفَرِّجِ الْكُرَبِ\nWA MOFARREJIL KORABE\nthe reliever of agonies,\nوَمُزِيلِ الْهَمَّ\nWA MOZEELIL HAMME\nthe remover of distress,\nوَكَاشِفِ الْبَلْوَىٰ\nWA KAASHEFIL BALWAA\nand the mitigator of ordeals.\nصَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَيْهِ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYHE\nAllah’s blessings be incessantly upon him\nوَعَلَىٰ آبَائِهِ الَائِمَّةِ الْهَادِينَ\nWA A’LAA AABAAA-EHIL A-IMMATIL HAADEENA\nand upon his fathers, the guiding Imams\nوَالْقَادَةِ الْمَيَامِينِ\nWAL QAADATIL MAYAAMEENE\nand the blessed leaders\nمَا طَلَعَتْ كَوَاكِبُ الَاسْحَارِ\nMAA TALA-A’T KAWAAKEBUL AS-HAARE\nwhenever stars of early dawn rise,\nوَاَوْرَقَتِ الَاشْجَارُ\nWA AWRAQATIL ASHJAARO\ntrees are furnished with leaves,\nوَاَينَعَتِ الَاثْمَارُ\nWA AYNA-A’TIL ASMAARO\nfruits are yielded,\nوَاخْتَلَفَ اللَّيْلُ وَالنَّهَارُ\nWAKH TALAFAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO\nnight and day follow each other,\nوغَرَّدَتِ الَاطْيَارُ\nWA GHARRADATIL ATYAARO\nand birds warble.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ انْفَعْنَا بِحُبِّهٖ\nALLAAHUMMAN FA’NAA BE-HUBBEHI\nO Allah, (please) make us benefit by our love for him\nوَاحْشُرْنَا فِي زُمْرَتِهٖ\nWAH SHURNAA FEE ZUMRATEHI\nand gather us in his group\nوَتَحْتَ لِوَائِهٖ\nWA TAHTA LE-WAAA-EHI\nand under his pennon.\nاِلٰهَ الْحَقِّ آمِينَ\nELAAHAL HAQQE AAMEENA\nO God of Truth, respond.\nرَبَّ الْعَالَمِينَ\nRABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nO Lord of the Worlds!"
  ]
